(91429, 3499, 811, '<td valign="top">In all honestly,  I think the photo would''ve been better if you cropped the top and showed more of hte beach.  that has a nice grainy texture, and it wouldn''t put puppy so close to the bottom.  karmat</td>', 'In all honestly,  I think the photo would''ve been better if you cropped the top and showed more of hte beach.  that has a nice grainy texture, and it wouldn''t put puppy so close to the bottom.  karmat', '2002-07-26 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91430, 3499, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  The composition is great on this photo.  Several lines - sky meets water, water meets beach, etc.    Although the ''texture'' is not as right in your face as some would expect, it definately does have lots of textures going on.  Great work. 9<br/>ruthann</td>', 'Good shot!  The composition is great on this photo.  Several lines - sky meets water, water meets beach, etc.    Although the ''texture'' is not as right in your face as some would expect, it definately does have lots of textures going on.  Great work. 9ruthann', '2002-07-27 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
