(90654, 3453, 1041, '<td valign="top">wow, there certainly have been quite a few misses, but that adds to the texture of the metal dividers.  good idea.  a little too dark on the right and i think i would have placed the bullseye a little further to the left, more along the rule of thirds.  but good entry for this challenge nevertheless. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'wow, there certainly have been quite a few misses, but that adds to the texture of the metal dividers.  good idea.  a little too dark on the right and i think i would have placed the bullseye a little further to the left, more along the rule of thirds.  but good entry for this challenge nevertheless. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-07-25 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90655, 3453, 1031, '<td valign="top">I espcially like that you can see the nicks on the "spokes" making (at least) four different textures.</td>', 'I espcially like that you can see the nicks on the "spokes" making (at least) four different textures.', '2002-07-26 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90656, 3453, 2667, '<td valign="top">not a bad effort. the photo is sharp, shows the texture of both the dart and the board nicely, and the color is good and rich. that said, the lighting is uneven and somewhat dim. as a result, the large black void behind the dart is distracting to me. also, i would like to have seen more of the dart. (or even more darts!)    ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics....5<br/>Meets Challenge...6<br/>Overall...5</td>', 'not a bad effort. the photo is sharp, shows the texture of both the dart and the board nicely, and the color is good and rich. that said, the lighting is uneven and somewhat dim. as a result, the large black void behind the dart is distracting to me. also, i would like to have seen more of the dart. (or even more darts!)    ~mcmurmaAesthetics....5Meets Challenge...6Overall...5', '2002-07-26 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90657, 3453, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a good picture...</td>', 'Great idea for a good picture...', '2002-07-26 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90658, 3453, 2312, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting demonstration of texture. I find the nicks in the metal rods draw my eyes around the photograph. The focus is spot on from the center to the right of the photograph, but just a little soft on the left side. The exposure is good, however the lighting is a bit harsh. If your camera has a provision for an external flash, using one bounced off a ceiling or other large white object can help eliminate shadows. If you have a camera that only has a built-in flash, you can try putting a few layers of tissue or a hankercheif over the flash to diffuse the light a bit. *7* -balynch</td>', 'This is a very interesting demonstration of texture. I find the nicks in the metal rods draw my eyes around the photograph. The focus is spot on from the center to the right of the photograph, but just a little soft on the left side. The exposure is good, however the lighting is a bit harsh. If your camera has a provision for an external flash, using one bounced off a ceiling or other large white object can help eliminate shadows. If you have a camera that only has a built-in flash, you can try putting a few layers of tissue or a hankercheif over the flash to diffuse the light a bit. *7* -balynch', '2002-07-26 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90659, 3453, 772, '<td valign="top">that looks a lot like Tim''s dartboard :)  I think this image could use a little more light behind the dart.. the texture is good and I like the way the lines lead me to the bullseye... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'that looks a lot like Tim''s dartboard :)  I think this image could use a little more light behind the dart.. the texture is good and I like the way the lines lead me to the bullseye... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-26 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
