(90791, 3460, 1066, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, technically excellent, well composed and great variety of texture....10..hokie</td>', 'Beautiful subject, technically excellent, well composed and great variety of texture....10..hokie', '2002-07-24 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90792, 3460, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition10<br/>Originality10<br/>Technical  Aspects9<br/>Meets Challenge9<br/>Total Score10<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition10Originality10Technical  Aspects9Meets Challenge9Total Score10For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90793, 3460, 641, '<td valign="top">Great closeup!</td>', 'Great closeup!', '2002-07-24 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90794, 3460, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like this one a LOT.</td>', 'I like this one a LOT.', '2002-07-24 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90795, 3460, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like how many types of feathers you got in the one shot.</td>', 'I like how many types of feathers you got in the one shot.', '2002-07-25 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90796, 3460, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I absolutely love this photo!  The contrast of the dark and light feathers is really striking, and you were able to capture such softness in the feathers around his eyes.... They look almost like snowflakes.  I can''t wait till the voting is over so  I can add this to my favorites!</td>', 'Wow!  I absolutely love this photo!  The contrast of the dark and light feathers is really striking, and you were able to capture such softness in the feathers around his eyes.... They look almost like snowflakes.  I can''t wait till the voting is over so  I can add this to my favorites!', '2002-07-25 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90797, 3460, 2460, '<td valign="top">Wonderful close-up</td>', 'Wonderful close-up', '2002-07-25 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90798, 3460, 671, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, framing.</td>', 'Great contrast, framing.', '2002-07-26 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90799, 3460, 2567, '<td valign="top">Wow ! Looks like he could actually blink.  Terrific photo. 10 and my top choice.</td>', 'Wow ! Looks like he could actually blink.  Terrific photo. 10 and my top choice.', '2002-07-26 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90800, 3460, 2370, '<td valign="top">nice capture! Excellent composition.</td>', 'nice capture! Excellent composition.', '2002-07-26 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90801, 3460, 2312, '<td valign="top">Wow--really nice shot. I like the detail in the eyelids and the feathers. Overall, I would give this a 7--the only thing I can see that could be improved is the focus around the beak, however, I know that may be a limitation of the camera since this is such a close-up macro shot. *7* -balynch</td>', 'Wow--really nice shot. I like the detail in the eyelids and the feathers. Overall, I would give this a 7--the only thing I can see that could be improved is the focus around the beak, however, I know that may be a limitation of the camera since this is such a close-up macro shot. *7* -balynch', '2002-07-26 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90802, 3460, 1003, '<td valign="top">super detail........what kind of camera and lense do you use?</td>', 'super detail........what kind of camera and lense do you use?', '2002-07-26 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90803, 3460, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is my pick for the winner. excellent composition, great lighting, superb contrast and colors. it also happens to meet the challenge very nicely. I am simply blown away by this image.</td>', 'this is my pick for the winner. excellent composition, great lighting, superb contrast and colors. it also happens to meet the challenge very nicely. I am simply blown away by this image.', '2002-07-26 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90804, 3460, 2172, '<td valign="top">OOOOOHHH...AAAAAHHHH  I like it!  the cropping is great and the focus - perhaps too much sharpness/contrast.   I love the eye.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'OOOOOHHH...AAAAAHHHH  I like it!  the cropping is great and the focus - perhaps too much sharpness/contrast.   I love the eye.  9Ruthann', '2002-07-26 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
