(90818, 3460, 509, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge b/c I was away, but if I had, yours would have won it for me too.  Great colors and contrast!  Definitely deserved to win I feel.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge b/c I was away, but if I had, yours would have won it for me too.  Great colors and contrast!  Definitely deserved to win I feel.', '2002-08-01 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
