(90822, 3461, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2002-07-22 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90823, 3461, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure. Nice that you could include the sky with some clouds (or were those jets that just went by?).</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure. Nice that you could include the sky with some clouds (or were those jets that just went by?).', '2002-07-22 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90824, 3461, 811, '<td valign="top">A little pixelated to me in spots.  You had a lot more "room," as far as submission sizes.  There are a lot of people in the forums that can explain this better than me, but sometimes it is possible to get rid of the pixelation by adjusting compression.   Very nice colors and composition. karmat</td>', 'A little pixelated to me in spots.  You had a lot more "room," as far as submission sizes.  There are a lot of people in the forums that can explain this better than me, but sometimes it is possible to get rid of the pixelation by adjusting compression.   Very nice colors and composition. karmat', '2002-07-23 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90825, 3461, 2777, '<td valign="top">Texture?</td>', 'Texture?', '2002-07-23 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90826, 3461, 640, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower, but doesn''t strike me as "texture".</td>', 'Beautiful flower, but doesn''t strike me as "texture".', '2002-07-23 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90827, 3461, 210, '<td valign="top">The image compression really hurt this.  Either that or the focus was off to begin with.</td>', 'The image compression really hurt this.  Either that or the focus was off to begin with.', '2002-07-23 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90828, 3461, 1944, '<td valign="top">Great flower photo well captured. There are some compression artifacts though which could have been reduced by using the whole 150k file size allowable.</td>', 'Great flower photo well captured. There are some compression artifacts though which could have been reduced by using the whole 150k file size allowable.', '2002-07-24 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90829, 3461, 1793, '<td valign="top">hehe. i like the angle - it springs out at ya.</td>', 'hehe. i like the angle - it springs out at ya.', '2002-07-24 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90830, 3461, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition5<br/>Originality6<br/>Technical  Aspects7<br/>Meets Challenge5<br/>Total Score6<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Originality6Technical  Aspects7Meets Challenge5Total Score6For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90831, 3461, 2311, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of your focus...</td>', 'beautiful use of your focus...', '2002-07-24 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90832, 3461, 671, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but I don''t see a lot of texture here.  If the fuzziness of the stames were clearer, and more dominant in the photo, it would have worked better for me.  Nevertheless, I give it a 6</td>', 'Good photo, but I don''t see a lot of texture here.  If the fuzziness of the stames were clearer, and more dominant in the photo, it would have worked better for me.  Nevertheless, I give it a 6', '2002-07-25 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90833, 3461, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a very vibrantg shot. reminds me of fireworks. I like the color contrast, and the shadows on the flower. the only thing I would try to improve is the depth of field, in order to get the anthers into sharp focus.</td>', 'this is a very vibrantg shot. reminds me of fireworks. I like the color contrast, and the shadows on the flower. the only thing I would try to improve is the depth of field, in order to get the anthers into sharp focus.', '2002-07-26 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90834, 3461, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Love the colors and the angle.  I feel as though something is amiss - but can''t put my finger on it-sorry - perhaps having the entire flower in focus, but not sure...cause the brown thingies make a nice circle in or out of focus.  Great work!  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great photo.  Love the colors and the angle.  I feel as though something is amiss - but can''t put my finger on it-sorry - perhaps having the entire flower in focus, but not sure...cause the brown thingies make a nice circle in or out of focus.  Great work!  9Ruthann', '2002-07-27 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90835, 3461, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well illuminated. I love this.  As for the challenge,  I wouldn''t rate it high in texture.</td>', 'Beautiful and well illuminated. I love this.  As for the challenge,  I wouldn''t rate it high in texture.', '2002-07-28 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90836, 3461, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice photo but also a very difficult one to make... at close range, it is difficult to get the depth of field you need for an object like this one... Overall, the composition is excellent.. the blurred stamens are slightly distracting... = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a very nice photo but also a very difficult one to make... at close range, it is difficult to get the depth of field you need for an object like this one... Overall, the composition is excellent.. the blurred stamens are slightly distracting... = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-28 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90837, 3461, 173, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot! Great depth</td>', 'Nice Shot! Great depth', '2002-07-28 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90838, 3462, 2317, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little less light</td>', 'Maybe a little less light', '2002-07-22 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90839, 3462, 2661, '<td valign="top">good idea for a texture. I also like the color contrast. I think a different composition would work better. perhaps one that highlghted certain parts of the lemon. the middle part with the spokes coming out, or where the fruit meets the rind, for instance, would provide more interest.</td>', 'good idea for a texture. I also like the color contrast. I think a different composition would work better. perhaps one that highlghted certain parts of the lemon. the middle part with the spokes coming out, or where the fruit meets the rind, for instance, would provide more interest.', '2002-07-22 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90840, 3462, 668, '<td valign="top">yummy</td>', 'yummy', '2002-07-22 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90841, 3462, 917, '<td valign="top">Use a reflector (tinfoil will work) to soften the shadow. You could have placed the lemon on a nicer surface.</td>', 'Use a reflector (tinfoil will work) to soften the shadow. You could have placed the lemon on a nicer surface.', '2002-07-22 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90842, 3462, 2481, '<td valign="top">good texture but higher angle with more of inside might have improved the contrast of inside and outside textures</td>', 'good texture but higher angle with more of inside might have improved the contrast of inside and outside textures', '2002-07-22 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(90843, 3462, 1360, '<td valign="top">Shadows on the bottom seem a little distracting.</td>', 'Shadows on the bottom seem a little distracting.', '2002-07-22 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90844, 3462, 1143, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the positioning, but it''s a nice close-up.</td>', 'Don''t like the positioning, but it''s a nice close-up.', '2002-07-22 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90845, 3462, 1644, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this... but it seems rushed.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this... but it seems rushed.', '2002-07-22 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90846, 3462, 2200, '<td valign="top">shadow distracts from subject.</td>', 'shadow distracts from subject.', '2002-07-22 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90847, 3462, 811, '<td valign="top">Kinda rough looking on the outside, I think.  It would have been good, maybe, to slice part of the front off so that the viewer sees the pulp as well. karmat</td>', 'Kinda rough looking on the outside, I think.  It would have been good, maybe, to slice part of the front off so that the viewer sees the pulp as well. karmat', '2002-07-22 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90848, 3462, 352, '<td valign="top">well set up shot.  excellent lighting and shadows</td>', 'well set up shot.  excellent lighting and shadows', '2002-07-23 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90849, 3462, 640, '<td valign="top">I love the title. Very clear and vivid shot. Makes me puker. Good work.</td>', 'I love the title. Very clear and vivid shot. Makes me puker. Good work.', '2002-07-23 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90850, 3462, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6,<br/>Technical Aspects7,<br/>Meets Challenge10,<br/>Originality8,<br/>Average Score8,<br/><br/>The shadow seems to interfere, and it would have been nice to accomplish more DOF.<br/>Autool.<br/><br/></td>', 'Composition6,Technical Aspects7,Meets Challenge10,Originality8,Average Score8,The shadow seems to interfere, and it would have been nice to accomplish more DOF.Autool.', '2002-07-23 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90851, 3462, 1280, '<td valign="top">It looks like the lemon has been squeezed.  The texture is nice though....a little blurry.  But I still like it.</td>', 'It looks like the lemon has been squeezed.  The texture is nice though....a little blurry.  But I still like it.', '2002-07-23 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90852, 3462, 1880, '<td valign="top">In Focus - 10, Lighting - 8, Color Levels - 9, DOF - 8 , Interesting Composition - 5, Interesting  Subject - 3 &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;  Tech Scores = 9, Subject Scores = 4, Final Score = 7, RLS</td>', 'In Focus - 10, Lighting - 8, Color Levels - 9, DOF - 8 , Interesting Composition - 5, Interesting  Subject - 3 &gt;&gt;&gt;  Tech Scores = 9, Subject Scores = 4, Final Score = 7, RLS', '2002-07-24 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90853, 3462, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good texture photograph.  I do like the texture on the sufrace of the lemon.  My critique on this photo is not an easy one.  My mind imagines the bright yellow color of a lemon, because it has seen this many times before.  The cast light on this particular lemon is making the surface look drab and unattractive to me.  I do like the shadow that has been cast and I do like the position of the subject in the frame.  I think the angle of the lighting is just messing up my mind''s image of a nice bright yellow lemon :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a good texture photograph.  I do like the texture on the sufrace of the lemon.  My critique on this photo is not an easy one.  My mind imagines the bright yellow color of a lemon, because it has seen this many times before.  The cast light on this particular lemon is making the surface look drab and unattractive to me.  I do like the shadow that has been cast and I do like the position of the subject in the frame.  I think the angle of the lighting is just messing up my mind''s image of a nice bright yellow lemon :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90854, 3462, 741, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I think 2 things could have made this better.  (1) sharper focus on the skin (2) getting rid of/moving the shadow.  It''s very dark and quite big.  A small reflector would have softened this or using natural light.  Also, did you try another background?  Strong blue or even orange would have set the colour off better.</td>', 'Great idea!  I think 2 things could have made this better.  (1) sharper focus on the skin (2) getting rid of/moving the shadow.  It''s very dark and quite big.  A small reflector would have softened this or using natural light.  Also, did you try another background?  Strong blue or even orange would have set the colour off better.', '2002-07-24 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90855, 3462, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice clean exposure and excellent detail. I also agree with the composition, simple and effective. My preference would be to get rid of the shadow and have the bottom lit a bit more to bring out the color.</td>', 'Nice clean exposure and excellent detail. I also agree with the composition, simple and effective. My preference would be to get rid of the shadow and have the bottom lit a bit more to bring out the color.', '2002-07-24 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90856, 3462, 1066, '<td valign="top">The subject has a lot of potential but the lighting is way off to show any good texture.  Plus, it often pays off the not include a straight on full coverage shot of fruit or vegetables.  Try just concentrating on a section of the lemon with only a portion of it filling a corner of the frame.  Then light from the side.  The secret to still life is having the lighting go from brighter to darker across the photo.   5...hokie</td>', 'The subject has a lot of potential but the lighting is way off to show any good texture.  Plus, it often pays off the not include a straight on full coverage shot of fruit or vegetables.  Try just concentrating on a section of the lemon with only a portion of it filling a corner of the frame.  Then light from the side.  The secret to still life is having the lighting go from brighter to darker across the photo.   5...hokie', '2002-07-25 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90857, 3462, 2791, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2002-07-26 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90858, 3462, 472, '<td valign="top">cool pic. #1 problem is the lighting.  the shadow right behind the lemon itself is distracting.  better to have lit it from the side.  or used 2 lights.  one from the front to light it and one from an angle to elim the shadow.  mag99</td>', 'cool pic. #1 problem is the lighting.  the shadow right behind the lemon itself is distracting.  better to have lit it from the side.  or used 2 lights.  one from the front to light it and one from an angle to elim the shadow.  mag99', '2002-07-26 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
