(90890, 3463, 772, '<td valign="top">phenomenal work... critiques:  it looks like the red dots in the upper left corner may be a result of over post processing... I see some jagged edges on the curves in the top half of the photo that may be a result of over sharpening... that being said, this is also an example of a photo that I find imperfect that still scores a 10.  the fluidity an smoothness of this image along with the nice lighting works very well for me..you have a great eye and mind to come up with this image for this challenge.. great work = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'phenomenal work... critiques:  it looks like the red dots in the upper left corner may be a result of over post processing... I see some jagged edges on the curves in the top half of the photo that may be a result of over sharpening... that being said, this is also an example of a photo that I find imperfect that still scores a 10.  the fluidity an smoothness of this image along with the nice lighting works very well for me..you have a great eye and mind to come up with this image for this challenge.. great work = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
