(90947, 3467, 2667, '<td valign="top">the hat has nice texture, but the photo is busy. too many elements present in my opinion. also, the black void beneath the hat is distracting. a photo of just the texture of the hat (or part of it) with only the wood-grain in the background would have worked better for me.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...4<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'the hat has nice texture, but the photo is busy. too many elements present in my opinion. also, the black void beneath the hat is distracting. a photo of just the texture of the hat (or part of it) with only the wood-grain in the background would have worked better for me.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...4Overall...4', '2002-07-24 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
