(90953, 3467, 734, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but did you try putting the hat in different places to see if it looked any better somewhere esle than on the rack?  the lighting and texture are nice but the photo leaves me wondering what if.</td>', 'A great idea, but did you try putting the hat in different places to see if it looked any better somewhere esle than on the rack?  the lighting and texture are nice but the photo leaves me wondering what if.', '2002-07-25 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
