(90956, 3467, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this design, and the texture of the hat.  At first the background bothered me, but then, as i looked at it, I decided that it actually added to the character of the hat.  I would recommend moving further ot your right next time, so that you can''t see into the other room. karmat</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this design, and the texture of the hat.  At first the background bothered me, but then, as i looked at it, I decided that it actually added to the character of the hat.  I would recommend moving further ot your right next time, so that you can''t see into the other room. karmat', '2002-07-29 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90957, 3468, 92, '<td valign="top">WOW ! You got pretty close ! I always see the hard stone like antlers. These are cool. I would have done my crop right up under them so there was little grass.</td>', 'WOW ! You got pretty close ! I always see the hard stone like antlers. These are cool. I would have done my crop right up under them so there was little grass.', '2002-07-22 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
