(90959, 3468, 2553, '<td valign="top">Too bad you could not have gotten more of a "close-up" of the antlers!  Without the title, I would think that the "texture" was the grass, trees, etc. - a little bit of everything.</td>', 'Too bad you could not have gotten more of a "close-up" of the antlers!  Without the title, I would think that the "texture" was the grass, trees, etc. - a little bit of everything.', '2002-07-22 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
