(90968, 3468, 2810, '<td valign="top">I like wildlife pics, and velvet is a cool texture, but this shot has many elements that I would not have incorporated.  This would have been better singling out the buck on the left and zooming in on his head.  Ideally, [and I am a purist] I would have tried to get a shot of him without the highway or post in the shot.</td>', 'I like wildlife pics, and velvet is a cool texture, but this shot has many elements that I would not have incorporated.  This would have been better singling out the buck on the left and zooming in on his head.  Ideally, [and I am a purist] I would have tried to get a shot of him without the highway or post in the shot.', '2002-07-22 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
