(90973, 3468, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice photo of opportunity.  I love deer shots.  Yes, they do have lovely velvetty horns, but even if I download this shot and blow it way the heck up, it''s still pretty hard to see that much detail.  The road behind the deers also conveys the sense of "tameness" in these two. 5 Swash</td>', 'This is a pretty nice photo of opportunity.  I love deer shots.  Yes, they do have lovely velvetty horns, but even if I download this shot and blow it way the heck up, it''s still pretty hard to see that much detail.  The road behind the deers also conveys the sense of "tameness" in these two. 5 Swash', '2002-07-23 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
