(90999, 3470, 1379, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this picture is incredible.  I love the way this leaf is lit and displayed, looking almost like a mouth.  Awesome picture.</td>', 'The simplicity of this picture is incredible.  I love the way this leaf is lit and displayed, looking almost like a mouth.  Awesome picture.', '2002-07-23 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91000, 3470, 811, '<td valign="top">The details show up very well.  I think a different background would have provided a little more "oomph."  karmat</td>', 'The details show up very well.  I think a different background would have provided a little more "oomph."  karmat', '2002-07-23 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91001, 3470, 1880, '<td valign="top">In Focus - 7, Lighting - 7, Color Levels - 7, DOF - 8 , Interesting Composition - 4, Interesting  Subject - 2 &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;  Tech Scores = 7, Subject Scores = 3, Final Score = 5, RLS</td>', 'In Focus - 7, Lighting - 7, Color Levels - 7, DOF - 8 , Interesting Composition - 4, Interesting  Subject - 2 &gt;&gt;&gt;  Tech Scores = 7, Subject Scores = 3, Final Score = 5, RLS', '2002-07-24 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91002, 3470, 1042, '<td valign="top">For some reason I like this. I think the contrast could have been bumped up a little more but that''s coming from someone who often adds too much contrast to her own photos. Just a preference for me. This is very interesting though...I''d also like to see a bit more light..it seems kind of dark. 7</td>', 'For some reason I like this. I think the contrast could have been bumped up a little more but that''s coming from someone who often adds too much contrast to her own photos. Just a preference for me. This is very interesting though...I''d also like to see a bit more light..it seems kind of dark. 7', '2002-07-24 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91003, 3470, 2881, '<td valign="top">Capture of interesting texture on a leaf. We should always look at things so closely!</td>', 'Capture of interesting texture on a leaf. We should always look at things so closely!', '2002-07-24 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91004, 3470, 2158, '<td valign="top">The texture of the leaf does show in parts, but overall I find this picture rather lacking in colour.</td>', 'The texture of the leaf does show in parts, but overall I find this picture rather lacking in colour.', '2002-07-24 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91005, 3470, 2810, '<td valign="top">Like the display of texture.  Background color and general setting seems out of place.  Good use of DOF technique and nice shadows on the leaf itself.  Doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Like the display of texture.  Background color and general setting seems out of place.  Good use of DOF technique and nice shadows on the leaf itself.  Doesn''t hold my interest.', '2002-07-25 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91006, 3470, 2204, '<td valign="top">Seems dull and cloudy.  Could be sharper.</td>', 'Seems dull and cloudy.  Could be sharper.', '2002-07-25 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91007, 3470, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photograph... I think a little more light would really add some nice punch to it :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an excellent photograph... I think a little more light would really add some nice punch to it :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-26 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91008, 3470, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice - soft and subtle, yet obvious for the challenge.  This is a very great picture.  Perhaps just a tad too dark (could be the screen).  8 from me!!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nice - soft and subtle, yet obvious for the challenge.  This is a very great picture.  Perhaps just a tad too dark (could be the screen).  8 from me!!Ruthann', '2002-07-26 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91009, 3470, 2564, '<td valign="top">Neat-o!  It looks like it would crack if I touched it.  Very dry.  I might have put it on and against a white background, and back-lit it to brighten the picture a bit, yet leave the leaf looking old and dry.</td>', 'Neat-o!  It looks like it would crack if I touched it.  Very dry.  I might have put it on and against a white background, and back-lit it to brighten the picture a bit, yet leave the leaf looking old and dry.', '2002-07-27 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
