(91068, 3474, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The blur in the front forces your eye to the upper right (as do the colors and lines) where it is more focused.  If it were turned upside down, the blur would be at the top, and I think it would feel a little more natural.  karmat</td>', 'Nice colors.  The blur in the front forces your eye to the upper right (as do the colors and lines) where it is more focused.  If it were turned upside down, the blur would be at the top, and I think it would feel a little more natural.  karmat', '2002-07-22 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91069, 3474, 2200, '<td valign="top">most of center is out of focus. good concept with these colors too</td>', 'most of center is out of focus. good concept with these colors too', '2002-07-22 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
