(91100, 3478, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good positioning of subjects, good color and perfect exposure. The only problem I see is with depth of field. It is so shallow that only a sliver is actually in focus. A higher f/stop will help. Also note that it is usually better to have the foreground in focus as a blurry foreground can give a sense of tension to a photo.</td>', 'Nice composition, good positioning of subjects, good color and perfect exposure. The only problem I see is with depth of field. It is so shallow that only a sliver is actually in focus. A higher f/stop will help. Also note that it is usually better to have the foreground in focus as a blurry foreground can give a sense of tension to a photo.', '2002-07-22 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91101, 3478, 2278, '<td valign="top">Needs more DOF - try a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Needs more DOF - try a smaller aperture.', '2002-07-22 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
