(91198, 3485, 811, '<td valign="top">Just me personally, but his is kinda gross.  Technically, though, it does show texture very well.  The background color, though it reminds me of a hospital and is thus appropriate, makes the picture kinda flat.  It also gets kinda dark in the lower left, maybe another light or bounce a light off something.  karmat</td>', 'Just me personally, but his is kinda gross.  Technically, though, it does show texture very well.  The background color, though it reminds me of a hospital and is thus appropriate, makes the picture kinda flat.  It also gets kinda dark in the lower left, maybe another light or bounce a light off something.  karmat', '2002-07-26 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
