(91210, 3486, 1041, '<td valign="top">this is quite an interesting take on texture, and cool tatoo.  overall, while i like the composition, the shot is too dark, and has not enough contrast in my opinion.  i tried playing with the two in an editing program, but when i increased brightness and/or contrast, the bedding in the background would become blown out, so maybe a tighter crop or other bedding and then a little brighter may be a possibility.  a tighter crop could also remove whatever that black band is on the left. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'this is quite an interesting take on texture, and cool tatoo.  overall, while i like the composition, the shot is too dark, and has not enough contrast in my opinion.  i tried playing with the two in an editing program, but when i increased brightness and/or contrast, the bedding in the background would become blown out, so maybe a tighter crop or other bedding and then a little brighter may be a possibility.  a tighter crop could also remove whatever that black band is on the left. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-24 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
