(91264, 3488, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph. Very nicely done. The texture is a stretch for me because it doesn''t make me want to reach out and touch it, or make me feel it in my imagination. I will score now and revisit it later, too....</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph. Very nicely done. The texture is a stretch for me because it doesn''t make me want to reach out and touch it, or make me feel it in my imagination. I will score now and revisit it later, too....', '2002-07-23 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91265, 3488, 811, '<td valign="top">Good skin tone color, and a good idea.</td>', 'Good skin tone color, and a good idea.', '2002-07-23 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91266, 3488, 2752, '<td valign="top">delicious..well done</td>', 'delicious..well done', '2002-07-23 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91267, 3488, 2586, '<td valign="top">Most of all I like the composition and the cropping. The red of the melon makes the eye wander off the page but they are held there by the fingers. Very effective. Nice idea of textures too (see the freckles as another texture).  Particularly like the sunlight on the lashes of the left eye. Titles are not that important to me but I was wondering about the smile in the title. The subject of the pic doesn''t seem to smile but is looking dead serious. Nice, technically good  img.</td>', 'Most of all I like the composition and the cropping. The red of the melon makes the eye wander off the page but they are held there by the fingers. Very effective. Nice idea of textures too (see the freckles as another texture).  Particularly like the sunlight on the lashes of the left eye. Titles are not that important to me but I was wondering about the smile in the title. The subject of the pic doesn''t seem to smile but is looking dead serious. Nice, technically good  img.', '2002-07-24 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91268, 3488, 671, '<td valign="top">I know that watermelon is cold and crisp and juicy.  Good job!</td>', 'I know that watermelon is cold and crisp and juicy.  Good job!', '2002-07-24 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
