make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91270, 3488, 1379, '<td valign="top">So cool!  I love not only the  juicy texture of the melon but also the feathery eyelashes of this child!  What a sweet photo!</td>', 'So cool!  I love not only the  juicy texture of the melon but also the feathery eyelashes of this child!  What a sweet photo!', '2002-07-24 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
