(91272, 3488, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait photo... very nice work... The texture of the watermelon slice works well, as does the texture of the freckles on the child''s face... I love the composition on this one.. it makes me wonder what he is looking at in the distance outside the frame.  The backlighting behind his eye on the right side of the frame adds a nice touch as well... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait photo... very nice work... The texture of the watermelon slice works well, as does the texture of the freckles on the child''s face... I love the composition on this one.. it makes me wonder what he is looking at in the distance outside the frame.  The backlighting behind his eye on the right side of the frame adds a nice touch as well... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-25 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
