(91347, 3495, 2810, '<td valign="top">Fairly well focused, and shows texture, but not really interesting.  This is another "wallpaper" shot, which could have been better by shooting a closeup of the rabbit''s head.  The only thing this photo does is to show the texture - it doesn''t demonstrate any other photography skills.</td>', 'Fairly well focused, and shows texture, but not really interesting.  This is another "wallpaper" shot, which could have been better by shooting a closeup of the rabbit''s head.  The only thing this photo does is to show the texture - it doesn''t demonstrate any other photography skills.', '2002-07-25 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
