(91349, 3495, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat texture shot, but if it''s a rabbit, I wonder why you didn''t include some of his face or ears?  This would have added some three dimensional qualities to this photo rather than having a flat image... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat texture shot, but if it''s a rabbit, I wonder why you didn''t include some of his face or ears?  This would have added some three dimensional qualities to this photo rather than having a flat image... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-25 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91350, 3495, 2490, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better for me if I could tell that it was a rabbit without you telling me in the title.  Maybe show his foot, or his ear, or something??  That would also give some depth.  7</td>', 'This would have worked better for me if I could tell that it was a rabbit without you telling me in the title.  Maybe show his foot, or his ear, or something??  That would also give some depth.  7', '2002-07-26 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
