(91371, 3496, 1944, '<td valign="top">I really like your photo, compositionally it''s one of my favorites. There is a lot of latitude in the highlights and shadows and you did a good job of capturing the best parts of both. You kind of shot yourself in the foot though by submitting such a small file. This kind of picture should be brutally sharp and if you had used the whole 150k it would have been better.</td>', 'I really like your photo, compositionally it''s one of my favorites. There is a lot of latitude in the highlights and shadows and you did a good job of capturing the best parts of both. You kind of shot yourself in the foot though by submitting such a small file. This kind of picture should be brutally sharp and if you had used the whole 150k it would have been better.', '2002-07-24 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
