(91412, 3499, 917, '<td valign="top">Its a good effort considering the unphotographable nature of fog. Having a subject in the picture is good, but I would prefer something to do with the fog, like a lighthouse.</td>', 'Its a good effort considering the unphotographable nature of fog. Having a subject in the picture is good, but I would prefer something to do with the fog, like a lighthouse.', '2002-07-23 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91413, 3499, 878, '<td valign="top">I like the shot more than I like the challenge concept, texture of fog is interesting but that is hard to capture on this type of a shot vs a forest.  The san has an interesting texture to it.  The water washing up on the shore would of been a great shot.</td>', 'I like the shot more than I like the challenge concept, texture of fog is interesting but that is hard to capture on this type of a shot vs a forest.  The san has an interesting texture to it.  The water washing up on the shore would of been a great shot.', '2002-07-23 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91414, 3499, 1024, '<td valign="top">I have always loved the texture of fog and I am very happy to see someone willing to take the risk of submitting a photo of it.  You are braver than I am.  I hope you do very well.</td>', 'I have always loved the texture of fog and I am very happy to see someone willing to take the risk of submitting a photo of it.  You are braver than I am.  I hope you do very well.', '2002-07-23 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
