(91421, 3499, 2302, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture of the dog in motion - but I wish he was further in the frame and not running off to the right side as it draws my eye to much to that direction. This was a stretch for me in if it meet the challenge.  I originally scored it a 4 - I would rather have seen a shot of the wave meeting the shore where more texture was visible, but I checked with my local weather guru who assured me that fog does have texture so I am bumping up the score to a 6.</td>', 'This is a good capture of the dog in motion - but I wish he was further in the frame and not running off to the right side as it draws my eye to much to that direction. This was a stretch for me in if it meet the challenge.  I originally scored it a 4 - I would rather have seen a shot of the wave meeting the shore where more texture was visible, but I checked with my local weather guru who assured me that fog does have texture so I am bumping up the score to a 6.', '2002-07-24 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91422, 3499, 641, '<td valign="top">What a great pet shot! I just love this! Makes me want a dog so much.</td>', 'What a great pet shot! I just love this! Makes me want a dog so much.', '2002-07-24 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
