(91453, 3500, 2586, '<td valign="top">The bright yellow leads my eye right out of the picture. Seems to me the bottom center yellow pepper has been cropped too much; might have been better if it had been shown whole. The visual interest for me is on the artichokes but everything else is pulling my eyes away from them.</td>', 'The bright yellow leads my eye right out of the picture. Seems to me the bottom center yellow pepper has been cropped too much; might have been better if it had been shown whole. The visual interest for me is on the artichokes but everything else is pulling my eyes away from them.', '2002-07-25 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91454, 3500, 1680, '<td valign="top">color looks a little flat, try adjusting the color balance to get more vibrent colors and increase the contrast some</td>', 'color looks a little flat, try adjusting the color balance to get more vibrent colors and increase the contrast some', '2002-07-25 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
