(91458, 3500, 878, '<td valign="top">You may want to try using a different application to resize your shots.  This has many visible lines to it and takes away from your shot.  The colors are nice but the eggplants are slightly dark for the border of one side.  The texture really is mostly on the artichokes but there in the background of the shot. 5</td>', 'You may want to try using a different application to resize your shots.  This has many visible lines to it and takes away from your shot.  The colors are nice but the eggplants are slightly dark for the border of one side.  The texture really is mostly on the artichokes but there in the background of the shot. 5', '2002-07-27 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
