(91500, 3504, 1005, '<td valign="top">You have texture, no problem.  I kinda get the "shy" aspect, but overall I still don''t like this shot all that much, sorry, it must be me.  The nearly blank, open space to the left is just present enough to make it a distraction.  If you were going for the 1/3 rule thing, it''s more like at 1/4 or 1/5th, so too far to the right.  Finally, estitically, would I want this photo hanging on my wall?  Sorry, no.   5 Swash</td>', 'You have texture, no problem.  I kinda get the "shy" aspect, but overall I still don''t like this shot all that much, sorry, it must be me.  The nearly blank, open space to the left is just present enough to make it a distraction.  If you were going for the 1/3 rule thing, it''s more like at 1/4 or 1/5th, so too far to the right.  Finally, estitically, would I want this photo hanging on my wall?  Sorry, no.   5 Swash', '2002-07-25 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
