(91565, 3514, 1041, '<td valign="top">to me, this is not the most interesting subject matter.  but, it does show texture, so that''s good.  have you tried not having the rock in the middle, but maybe following the ROT?  that way, the viewer''s eyes are allowed to wonder around your shot a little more.  the shot also seems a little pixelated, not sure if that''s just your camera though, because you have a decent file size. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'to me, this is not the most interesting subject matter.  but, it does show texture, so that''s good.  have you tried not having the rock in the middle, but maybe following the ROT?  that way, the viewer''s eyes are allowed to wonder around your shot a little more.  the shot also seems a little pixelated, not sure if that''s just your camera though, because you have a decent file size. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-23 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
