(91614, 3518, 811, '<td valign="top">I think one of hte strongest points of this picture is hte addition of some color.  I think a lower camera perspective may have made it seem a little less "flat."</td>', 'I think one of hte strongest points of this picture is hte addition of some color.  I think a lower camera perspective may have made it seem a little less "flat."', '2002-07-26 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
