(91616, 3518, 878, '<td valign="top">slightly busy if you could of taken some of these items and placed them on smooth sand it would of been a better effect.  The top of the shot is in focus whereas the bottom goes a bit out, not sure if you were going for that effect. 4</td>', 'slightly busy if you could of taken some of these items and placed them on smooth sand it would of been a better effect.  The top of the shot is in focus whereas the bottom goes a bit out, not sure if you were going for that effect. 4', '2002-07-27 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91617, 3518, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice but overwhelming.  Too much to look at in this pic.  Good depth of field and use of color and texture.</td>', 'Nice but overwhelming.  Too much to look at in this pic.  Good depth of field and use of color and texture.', '2002-07-28 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
