(91620, 3519, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really nice contrast. The light curved feather, and the dark hard lines of the wood. Very good.</td>', 'This is really nice contrast. The light curved feather, and the dark hard lines of the wood. Very good.', '2002-07-22 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
