(91626, 3519, 1759, '<td valign="top">The feature is a nice touch. Good job on composition and exposure. I do however think it might benifit from just a bit of unsharp mask.</td>', 'The feature is a nice touch. Good job on composition and exposure. I do however think it might benifit from just a bit of unsharp mask.', '2002-07-22 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
