(91635, 3519, 2615, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subjects!</td>', 'Great composition and subjects!', '2002-07-23 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91636, 3519, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition6<br/>Originality7<br/>Technical  Aspects5<br/>Meets Challenge8<br/>Total Score7<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Originality7Technical  Aspects5Meets Challenge8Total Score7For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91637, 3519, 1, '<td valign="top">nice composure.</td>', 'nice composure.', '2002-07-24 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91638, 3519, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the feather adds a nice touch, but in my opinion, it needs to be to the left, just a touch to feel a little more balanced. karmat</td>', 'I think the feather adds a nice touch, but in my opinion, it needs to be to the left, just a touch to feel a little more balanced. karmat', '2002-07-24 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91639, 3519, 436, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the deep lines work in the layout of the photo. The lighting is strong, but not overpowering, but the feather was a stroke of genius.  I assume you placed it? It''s texture is such a contrast, the juxtaposition so sublime.  Truly a marvelous shot. 10 crisa58</td>', 'I really like the way the deep lines work in the layout of the photo. The lighting is strong, but not overpowering, but the feather was a stroke of genius.  I assume you placed it? It''s texture is such a contrast, the juxtaposition so sublime.  Truly a marvelous shot. 10 crisa58', '2002-07-24 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91640, 3519, 2079, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, it is one of my top 3 for this challenge.  I personally do not like the feather. I have a bird, so most feathers in my office are un-welcome.</td>', 'I love this shot, it is one of my top 3 for this challenge.  I personally do not like the feather. I have a bird, so most feathers in my office are un-welcome.', '2002-07-24 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91641, 3519, 1680, '<td valign="top">great shot, i dont know if you relally need the feather there though, there is more than enough texture in the wood alone</td>', 'great shot, i dont know if you relally need the feather there though, there is more than enough texture in the wood alone', '2002-07-25 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91642, 3519, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like your picture very much, but i find it''s not as sharp as it should be.</td>', 'I like your picture very much, but i find it''s not as sharp as it should be.', '2002-07-26 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91643, 3519, 2312, '<td valign="top">An absolutely stunning texture!!! The dry, almost petrified looking wood really contrasts with the delicate feather. Focus is sharp except for the very top edge of the frame, and the exposure is right on. *8* -balynch</td>', 'An absolutely stunning texture!!! The dry, almost petrified looking wood really contrasts with the delicate feather. Focus is sharp except for the very top edge of the frame, and the exposure is right on. *8* -balynch', '2002-07-26 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91644, 3519, 772, '<td valign="top">The feather on the stump adds a nice touch :)  It offers a nice bit of contrast and brightness to the somewhat ''cold'' image of the old wood.  I think you did an excellent job of composing this shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The feather on the stump adds a nice touch :)  It offers a nice bit of contrast and brightness to the somewhat ''cold'' image of the old wood.  I think you did an excellent job of composing this shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-27 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91645, 3519, 878, '<td valign="top">A bit soft on the tree, I wish it had a sharper focus on it.  I like feather as well, nice layout and idea. 7</td>', 'A bit soft on the tree, I wish it had a sharper focus on it.  I like feather as well, nice layout and idea. 7', '2002-07-27 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91646, 3519, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice photography.  The feather gives it a little something extra.  I like that it is not completely centered.  Good lighting too.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nice photography.  The feather gives it a little something extra.  I like that it is not completely centered.  Good lighting too.  9Ruthann', '2002-07-28 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91647, 3520, 2317, '<td valign="top">I liked the title... a little unfocused</td>', 'I liked the title... a little unfocused', '2002-07-22 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91648, 3520, 2661, '<td valign="top">so who lives on planet thumb. thumbidians? good texture. you could have brought out the grooves a lot more had you lit it from the side.</td>', 'so who lives on planet thumb. thumbidians? good texture. you could have brought out the grooves a lot more had you lit it from the side.', '2002-07-22 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91649, 3520, 668, '<td valign="top">hahaa  yes.</td>', 'hahaa  yes.', '2002-07-22 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91650, 3520, 1281, '<td valign="top">It´s out of focus, and composition isn´t very interesting. The shadow on the left doesn´t look like a planets one, at least for me.  But nice idea.</td>', 'It´s out of focus, and composition isn´t very interesting. The shadow on the left doesn´t look like a planets one, at least for me.  But nice idea.', '2002-07-22 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91651, 3520, 2752, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2002-07-22 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91652, 3520, 1796, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if you couldn''t have gotten more detail out of this with less compression. the picture looks a bit flat to me and I guess that might be less of an issue if the file was larger/jpeg quality higher. tell me if I''m wrong.<br/>5 beegee</td>', 'I''m wondering if you couldn''t have gotten more detail out of this with less compression. the picture looks a bit flat to me and I guess that might be less of an issue if the file was larger/jpeg quality higher. tell me if I''m wrong.5 beegee', '2002-07-22 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(91653, 3520, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simple composition, but the skin tone is a little orangy to  me.  karmat</td>', 'I like the simple composition, but the skin tone is a little orangy to  me.  karmat', '2002-07-23 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91654, 3520, 640, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus', '2002-07-23 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91655, 3520, 671, '<td valign="top">good texture study!  Your choice of title helped me relate to the picture.</td>', 'good texture study!  Your choice of title helped me relate to the picture.', '2002-07-24 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91656, 3520, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good representation of testure.  I personally would prefer better focus and less flash glare. 5</td>', 'Good representation of testure.  I personally would prefer better focus and less flash glare. 5', '2002-07-24 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91657, 3520, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the idea -- I want to see a spaceship in orbit over there on the right...</td>', 'I like the idea -- I want to see a spaceship in orbit over there on the right...', '2002-07-25 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91658, 3520, 1041, '<td valign="top">good texture, nice black background, but the thumb looks slightly out of focus.  did you get closer than your camera allows?  mine often does that ... it beeps as if it has focused, but in reality it has failed ... -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'good texture, nice black background, but the thumb looks slightly out of focus.  did you get closer than your camera allows?  mine often does that ... it beeps as if it has focused, but in reality it has failed ... -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-25 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91659, 3520, 772, '<td valign="top">This is really neat texture... It seems that the focus on the thumbprint texture may be a little weak and I see some signs of jpeg compression in the bkack area of the photo... I think you need a little larger file size to remove some of this... = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is really neat texture... It seems that the focus on the thumbprint texture may be a little weak and I see some signs of jpeg compression in the bkack area of the photo... I think you need a little larger file size to remove some of this... = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-25 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91660, 3520, 2791, '<td valign="top">nice thumb</td>', 'nice thumb', '2002-07-26 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91661, 3520, 2158, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough and the lighting is to head on.  Side lighting would make the texture stand out more.</td>', 'Not sharp enough and the lighting is to head on.  Side lighting would make the texture stand out more.', '2002-07-26 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91662, 3520, 637, '<td valign="top">Strange coloring.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'Strange coloring.  5 sjgleah', '2002-07-27 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91663, 3520, 1, '<td valign="top">The left side doesn''t seem as in focus as the center is... I think more DOF is required, trying playing with your aperture.</td>', 'The left side doesn''t seem as in focus as the center is... I think more DOF is required, trying playing with your aperture.', '2002-07-27 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91664, 3520, 1280, '<td valign="top">Hey I saw this print on the post office wall!</td>', 'Hey I saw this print on the post office wall!', '2002-07-28 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91665, 3522, 92, '<td valign="top">GREAT textures. DOF is nice. the only thing I would have done is brighten it some with levels.</td>', 'GREAT textures. DOF is nice. the only thing I would have done is brighten it some with levels.', '2002-07-22 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91666, 3522, 1877, '<td valign="top">Oooh. I like! nice and crispy :) good job 7</td>', 'Oooh. I like! nice and crispy :) good job 7', '2002-07-22 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91667, 3522, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice variations of texture and good composition.</td>', 'Nice variations of texture and good composition.', '2002-07-22 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91668, 3522, 2607, '<td valign="top">like the chip paint on the horse<br/>shows nice texture</td>', 'like the chip paint on the horseshows nice texture', '2002-07-22 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91669, 3522, 668, '<td valign="top">interesting. almost morbid. like a dream dissolving.</td>', 'interesting. almost morbid. like a dream dissolving.', '2002-07-22 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91670, 3522, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a great deal; find the flower (I think it''s a flower) in the top background to be just a tiny bit distracting.</td>', 'I like this photo a great deal; find the flower (I think it''s a flower) in the top background to be just a tiny bit distracting.', '2002-07-22 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91671, 3522, 1796, '<td valign="top">poor thing... nice effect for texture. would like to see the original and how it changes the image, if you shot this in color. 6 beegee</td>', 'poor thing... nice effect for texture. would like to see the original and how it changes the image, if you shot this in color. 6 beegee', '2002-07-22 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91672, 3522, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Kee</td>', 'Nice work. Kee', '2002-07-22 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91673, 3522, 2481, '<td valign="top">good texture; nice cropping and contrast with background</td>', 'good texture; nice cropping and contrast with background', '2002-07-22 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91674, 3522, 1569, '<td valign="top">A bit under exposed. When you photograph light subjects you have to fool the auto metering system into taking a darker picture. Meter on a darker part(try to find something medium grey)and press the shutter button down halfway to set the exposure.Then move to frame the subject and press down all the way.Or if you have over and under exposure buttons on the camera experiment with them.</td>', 'A bit under exposed. When you photograph light subjects you have to fool the auto metering system into taking a darker picture. Meter on a darker part(try to find something medium grey)and press the shutter button down halfway to set the exposure.Then move to frame the subject and press down all the way.Or if you have over and under exposure buttons on the camera experiment with them.', '2002-07-22 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91675, 3522, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very well done texture piece.</td>', 'Very well done texture piece.', '2002-07-22 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91676, 3522, 811, '<td valign="top">Well framed, though I think it may have been more interesting (to me) from a different angle.  I feels kinda "straight on" and thus seems a little flat.  Nice example for texture. karmat</td>', 'Well framed, though I think it may have been more interesting (to me) from a different angle.  I feels kinda "straight on" and thus seems a little flat.  Nice example for texture. karmat', '2002-07-22 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91677, 3522, 2317, '<td valign="top">Needs more detailment</td>', 'Needs more detailment', '2002-07-23 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91678, 3522, 2810, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Good example of texture with creativity in choosing the subject.</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Good example of texture with creativity in choosing the subject.', '2002-07-23 03:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91679, 3522, 352, '<td valign="top">very appealing and intersting shot</td>', 'very appealing and intersting shot', '2002-07-23 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91680, 3522, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like this texture photo very much and I am sure that what makes it so special is the use of Black and White.</td>', 'I like this texture photo very much and I am sure that what makes it so special is the use of Black and White.', '2002-07-23 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91681, 3522, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition8,<br/>Technical Aspects7,<br/>Meets Challenge10,<br/>Originality10,<br/>Average Score9,<br/>Autool.<br/></td>', 'Composition8,Technical Aspects7,Meets Challenge10,Originality10,Average Score9,Autool.', '2002-07-23 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91682, 3522, 772, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and it works phenomenally well as a black and white... The exposure on this image is right on the money...  I would bump the score on this photo by one point if you had held up a black cloth or something dark behind this unicorn to completely wash out the background.  The dark background works well, but the single light colored flower bloom is a minor distraction in the overall great impact of this photo... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is beautiful and it works phenomenally well as a black and white... The exposure on this image is right on the money...  I would bump the score on this photo by one point if you had held up a black cloth or something dark behind this unicorn to completely wash out the background.  The dark background works well, but the single light colored flower bloom is a minor distraction in the overall great impact of this photo... good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91683, 3522, 1793, '<td valign="top">i love the name. the image is ... deep, while itsnot. 9 because the white bush above the head shouldn''t be there.</td>', 'i love the name. the image is ... deep, while itsnot. 9 because the white bush above the head shouldn''t be there.', '2002-07-24 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91684, 3522, 641, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this shot.. I''m captivated by it. Probably because I love unicorns and I collected them as a little girl and it just brings back those memories. At any rate.. I like this. Good texture, I think I''d like to see the color version though.</td>', 'The more I look at this shot.. I''m captivated by it. Probably because I love unicorns and I collected them as a little girl and it just brings back those memories. At any rate.. I like this. Good texture, I think I''d like to see the color version though.', '2002-07-24 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91685, 3522, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good find on this subject!  Good compositoin though I think just a tad tight. Nice crisp focus and lighting that complements the subject. My only minor nitpick would be to get rid of the background distraction in the upper left (or minimize it with background blur or such a high f/stop and shutter speed that it becomes near black).</td>', 'Good find on this subject!  Good compositoin though I think just a tad tight. Nice crisp focus and lighting that complements the subject. My only minor nitpick would be to get rid of the background distraction in the upper left (or minimize it with background blur or such a high f/stop and shutter speed that it becomes near black).', '2002-07-24 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91686, 3522, 1003, '<td valign="top">great show of texture.</td>', 'great show of texture.', '2002-07-24 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91687, 3522, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice, except for the distracting background top left.  Perhaps you could have changed your angle slightly to avoid it.</td>', 'Nice, except for the distracting background top left.  Perhaps you could have changed your angle slightly to avoid it.', '2002-07-24 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(91688, 3522, 640, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear. Good comparison of 2 textures.</td>', 'Very sharp and clear. Good comparison of 2 textures.', '2002-07-25 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
