(91800, 3530, 2337, '<td valign="top">You know the wall is rough cause you were there... I can''t really ''see'' the roughness in the photo though.  I think to make this shot work you would have needed to get your feet wet... literially... a close up of the water coming down the red part of the wall would be more interesting. Of course, that''s just me.</td>', 'You know the wall is rough cause you were there... I can''t really ''see'' the roughness in the photo though.  I think to make this shot work you would have needed to get your feet wet... literially... a close up of the water coming down the red part of the wall would be more interesting. Of course, that''s just me.', '2002-07-22 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
