(91902, 3536, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and I like the simpleness of the colors.  It is a good picture, but I think it would be more effective for this challenge if we could see the texture of the grass more, or if there was more of the ball in detail.  The roughness of the grass and the smoothness of the ball would be nice contrasts.  karmat</td>', 'Interesting composition, and I like the simpleness of the colors.  It is a good picture, but I think it would be more effective for this challenge if we could see the texture of the grass more, or if there was more of the ball in detail.  The roughness of the grass and the smoothness of the ball would be nice contrasts.  karmat', '2002-07-23 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
