(92031, 3547, 772, '<td valign="top">This particular image does not create a sense of great texture for me.  I see the texture here, but this texture is something i see every day... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This particular image does not create a sense of great texture for me.  I see the texture here, but this texture is something i see every day... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-22 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
