(92033, 3547, 811, '<td valign="top">The whole picture seems a little too weighted on teh left to me.  Maybe if the camera were over to the left a fraction, so tha that the open space on the right wasn''t there, it would feel more balanced to me.  karmat</td>', 'The whole picture seems a little too weighted on teh left to me.  Maybe if the camera were over to the left a fraction, so tha that the open space on the right wasn''t there, it would feel more balanced to me.  karmat', '2002-07-22 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
