(92035, 3547, 1041, '<td valign="top">tree bark works well for texture.  the focus is good on the bark, too.  the light shining through the leaves is a little bright and the rope to the right is a tad distracting imo.  i''m not sure what to suggest (short of asking your to place a bird or squirrel on the tree ;) to add a little more of a focal point for interest, i always seem to have that problem with ''up the tree shots'', sorry. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'tree bark works well for texture.  the focus is good on the bark, too.  the light shining through the leaves is a little bright and the rope to the right is a tad distracting imo.  i''m not sure what to suggest (short of asking your to place a bird or squirrel on the tree ;) to add a little more of a focal point for interest, i always seem to have that problem with ''up the tree shots'', sorry. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-23 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
