nt to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92040, 3547, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice bark. The angel doesn''t do anything for me. Would have been nicer without the rope.</td>', 'Nice bark. The angel doesn''t do anything for me. Would have been nicer without the rope.', '2002-07-25 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92041, 3547, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the concept/perspective of this shot.......reason: I have done it myself. Your shot is nice but the DOF is a bit short. Also I think I''d of cropped off the rope on the right. KEE</td>', 'I love the concept/perspective of this shot.......reason: I have done it myself. Your shot is nice but the DOF is a bit short. Also I think I''d of cropped off the rope on the right. KEE', '2002-07-26 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92042, 3547, 1005, '<td valign="top">Tree bark portion of shot has great texture, is well focused and overall nicely done.  The other half of this shot, not so good.  Sky overblown and glaring.  Leaves are difficult to see, they offer nice color contrast, so I see why you included them, but I think this would have been better with that part cropped off.  What''s with the rope?  Sorry, I talked myself down, started as a 6, now 5.  Swash</td>', 'Tree bark portion of shot has great texture, is well focused and overall nicely done.  The other half of this shot, not so good.  Sky overblown and glaring.  Leaves are difficult to see, they offer nice color contrast, so I see why you included them, but I think this would have been better with that part cropped off.  What''s with the rope?  Sorry, I talked myself down, started as a 6, now 5.  Swash', '2002-07-26 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92043, 3547, 1031, '<td valign="top">I might have tried to cut the exposure a bit to reduce the glare in the upper part.</td>', 'I might have tried to cut the exposure a bit to reduce the glare in the upper part.', '2002-07-27 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92044, 3548, 1569, '<td valign="top">Wow,this looks like an oil painting,nice one!</td>', 'Wow,this looks like an oil painting,nice one!', '2002-07-22 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
