(92123, 3552, 2337, '<td valign="top">Subject didn''t do much for me... You might want to try reshooting just the bones.  While all of the toys have texture, they really scream texture.  Also I''m not sure why, but the focus seems a bit soft.  It might have happened in camera or maybe during the resize (I''m terrible at that)  but ''texture REALLY needs sharp focus to work well.  If you intended the soft focus, sorry, but for me it didn''t work...  But that''s just me :)<br/><br/>NOTE : After adjusting my monitor, this image improved dramatically... Please ignore most of my comment above. I still think the bone would be better as the central theme,  but most of the ''softness'' was due to my monitor, not you.  Sorry ''bout that... Bumping you 2 points to a 6</td>', 'Subject didn''t do much for me... You might want to try reshooting just the bones.  While all of the toys have texture, they really scream texture.  Also I''m not sure why, but the focus seems a bit soft.  It might have happened in camera or maybe during the resize (I''m terrible at that)  but ''texture REALLY needs sharp focus to work well.  If you intended the soft focus, sorry, but for me it didn''t work...  But that''s just me :)NOTE : After adjusting my monitor, this image improved dramatically... Please ignore most of my comment above. I still think the bone would be better as the central theme,  but most of the ''softness'' was due to my monitor, not you.  Sorry ''bout that... Bumping you 2 points to a 6', '2002-07-25 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
