(92209, 3559, 889, '<td valign="top">mmm crunchy, even in milk. Interesting thing, milk photographs brownish. The networks previously used Diluted Elmers Glue. Thats why the spoon they lift to their mouths has milk in it and the spoon they put in their mouths doesnt. That second spoon is always dry on the bottom and the top.</td>', 'mmm crunchy, even in milk. Interesting thing, milk photographs brownish. The networks previously used Diluted Elmers Glue. Thats why the spoon they lift to their mouths has milk in it and the spoon they put in their mouths doesnt. That second spoon is always dry on the bottom and the top.', '2002-07-22 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
