(92228, 3559, 573, '<td valign="top">Well done picture, composition, focus, exposure, contrast and saturation all good. Would I frame this immage and hange it on my wall?  Maybe if I were a manufacture of nails or breakfast cerials.</td>', 'Well done picture, composition, focus, exposure, contrast and saturation all good. Would I frame this immage and hange it on my wall?  Maybe if I were a manufacture of nails or breakfast cerials.', '2002-07-24 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
