(92441, 3579, 1041, '<td valign="top">where was this entry for the transparency challenge??? this is a pretty cool shot, i''m guessing i''m looking through some kind of glass door or panel, but i don''t know what i''m looking at, but that''s ok.  i like those ovals and red lines.  this just doesn''t really say ''texture'' to me (disclaimer: i know everything''s got texture, but - imho - this isn''t the greatest representation for it).. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'where was this entry for the transparency challenge??? this is a pretty cool shot, i''m guessing i''m looking through some kind of glass door or panel, but i don''t know what i''m looking at, but that''s ok.  i like those ovals and red lines.  this just doesn''t really say ''texture'' to me (disclaimer: i know everything''s got texture, but - imho - this isn''t the greatest representation for it).. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-26 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92442, 3579, 2158, '<td valign="top">This would have fitted better in the transparency challenge.</td>', 'This would have fitted better in the transparency challenge.', '2002-07-26 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92443, 3580, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. However, I find the img somewhat flat; not enough contrast and even though the chains have texture I don''t find the object complimenting the dollar bills. Some smooth and highly reflective surface would have been better.</td>', 'Nice idea. However, I find the img somewhat flat; not enough contrast and even though the chains have texture I don''t find the object complimenting the dollar bills. Some smooth and highly reflective surface would have been better.', '2002-07-22 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92444, 3580, 2068, '<td valign="top">This would have worked great for corporate america.  Its a good photo, it is a little too bright.</td>', 'This would have worked great for corporate america.  Its a good photo, it is a little too bright.', '2002-07-22 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92445, 3580, 1877, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the chains, part of me likes them by themselves.. but.. then.. the money.. makes it more interesting, good job :) 6</td>', 'Great texture on the chains, part of me likes them by themselves.. but.. then.. the money.. makes it more interesting, good job :) 6', '2002-07-22 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92446, 3580, 2661, '<td valign="top">looks like you cranked the contrast way up to emphasize the textures. I really like the idea, but i''m wondering if you cranked it up just a bit too high. the texture of the chains seems to have been turned into static. you know, you should do something like this for the corporata america challenge!</td>', 'looks like you cranked the contrast way up to emphasize the textures. I really like the idea, but i''m wondering if you cranked it up just a bit too high. the texture of the chains seems to have been turned into static. you know, you should do something like this for the corporata america challenge!', '2002-07-22 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92447, 3580, 327, '<td valign="top">Dang.......this would be great for the NEW challenge too. I love this also for texture..and really love the b&amp;w. This is fine work. Kee</td>', 'Dang.......this would be great for the NEW challenge too. I love this also for texture..and really love the b&w. This is fine work. Kee', '2002-07-22 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92448, 3580, 2256, '<td valign="top">interesting....</td>', 'interesting....', '2002-07-22 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92449, 3580, 1, '<td valign="top">Very noisey, though that might be the effect you were going for with your post-camera alterations -- it does bring out the textures.  A nice idea.</td>', 'Very noisey, though that might be the effect you were going for with your post-camera alterations -- it does bring out the textures.  A nice idea.', '2002-07-22 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92450, 3580, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice texture on chain; not sure how the dollar bill fits in</td>', 'nice texture on chain; not sure how the dollar bill fits in', '2002-07-22 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92451, 3580, 1360, '<td valign="top">This photo almost looks like a photocopy... But that strange "texture" to it, adds something to it.</td>', 'This photo almost looks like a photocopy... But that strange "texture" to it, adds something to it.', '2002-07-22 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
