(92480, 3585, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent texture... excellent choice of subject as well... The only critique I have for this photo is a personal taste of mine... I would like to have seen this shot done from the exact same vantage point with the camera rotated about 15 or 20 degrees to the left to create a stronger diagonal in the image... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent texture... excellent choice of subject as well... The only critique I have for this photo is a personal taste of mine... I would like to have seen this shot done from the exact same vantage point with the camera rotated about 15 or 20 degrees to the left to create a stronger diagonal in the image... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-23 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92481, 3585, 2560, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I think more of the boat would be even more interesting but might lose some of the texture. 10</td>', 'Nice picture.  I think more of the boat would be even more interesting but might lose some of the texture. 10', '2002-07-23 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92482, 3585, 2278, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the neglect of this old hull.  The soft clouds add a nice additional texture.</td>', 'Good job capturing the neglect of this old hull.  The soft clouds add a nice additional texture.', '2002-07-24 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92483, 3585, 436, '<td valign="top">Very evocative and nicely composed. Good detail on the falking paint.  The deep blue of the sky and white of the boat are great together.  I can almost smell the freshness of a nearby body of water.</td>', 'Very evocative and nicely composed. Good detail on the falking paint.  The deep blue of the sky and white of the boat are great together.  I can almost smell the freshness of a nearby body of water.', '2002-07-24 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92484, 3585, 749, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, superb composition, deserving of a 10 :o)<br/>- Manic -</td>', 'Beautifully lit, superb composition, deserving of a 10 :o)- Manic -', '2002-07-24 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92485, 3585, 1793, '<td valign="top">weathered history... nice.</td>', 'weathered history... nice.', '2002-07-24 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92486, 3585, 573, '<td valign="top">This image is an exclent example of how harsh lighting from direct or cloudy bright sun can iluminate the detail in weathered wood.  "K205" I wonder if that has some historical significance?  One of my top ten picks.</td>', 'This image is an exclent example of how harsh lighting from direct or cloudy bright sun can iluminate the detail in weathered wood.  "K205" I wonder if that has some historical significance?  One of my top ten picks.', '2002-07-24 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92487, 3585, 1066, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, technically excellent, well composed and great variety of texture, excellent color saturation....10..hokie</td>', 'Interesting subject, technically excellent, well composed and great variety of texture, excellent color saturation....10..hokie', '2002-07-24 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92488, 3585, 2634, '<td valign="top">great representation of texture with color, contrast, composition and design.</td>', 'great representation of texture with color, contrast, composition and design.', '2002-07-24 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92489, 3585, 789, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2002-07-26 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92490, 3585, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done, good subject matter for texture.</td>', 'This is very nicely done, good subject matter for texture.', '2002-07-26 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92491, 3585, 2312, '<td valign="top">The multitude of textures make this a great photograph. Everything from the peeling paint, to the rusting metal, to the left behind imprints, and even the clouds come together to make a artistic photograph. The only negative comment I have is that I think the sharpening may have been a bit overdone. But you could not do any better in any other area. *9* -bryan</td>', 'The multitude of textures make this a great photograph. Everything from the peeling paint, to the rusting metal, to the left behind imprints, and even the clouds come together to make a artistic photograph. The only negative comment I have is that I think the sharpening may have been a bit overdone. But you could not do any better in any other area. *9* -bryan', '2002-07-26 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92492, 3585, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shape and contrast with the sky--love the paintwork</td>', 'Beautiful shape and contrast with the sky--love the paintwork', '2002-07-27 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92493, 3585, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and use of texture. 10</td>', 'Nice colors and use of texture. 10', '2002-07-27 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92494, 3585, 2079, '<td valign="top">Great color, excellent beached feel. I''m dying to see the rest of the boat. This is one of my top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'Great color, excellent beached feel. I''m dying to see the rest of the boat. This is one of my top 10 for this challenge.', '2002-07-28 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92495, 3585, 1280, '<td valign="top">wouldn''t change a thing.  Very nice! I''m expecting to see the animals come on by twosies.  Looks ancient!</td>', 'wouldn''t change a thing.  Very nice! I''m expecting to see the animals come on by twosies.  Looks ancient!', '2002-07-28 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92496, 3585, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the deep blue sky, and how you have composed this shot.  It makes the old boat look interesting, and not just a relic laying around somewhere.</td>', 'I really like the deep blue sky, and how you have composed this shot.  It makes the old boat look interesting, and not just a relic laying around somewhere.', '2002-07-29 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
