(92546, 3590, 1005, '<td valign="top">Soo dark and gloomy, especially in B&amp;W, seems awkward with the title.  When I think of warm, I think of colors like red and yellow.  I started by grading this shot as a 5, the I don''t understand vote for me.  I don''t see much sense of texture.  If you would be so kind as to send me a note after the challenge week, I would like to understand this photo better.  (see my profile for e-mail info)  3 Swash</td>', 'Soo dark and gloomy, especially in B&W, seems awkward with the title.  When I think of warm, I think of colors like red and yellow.  I started by grading this shot as a 5, the I don''t understand vote for me.  I don''t see much sense of texture.  If you would be so kind as to send me a note after the challenge week, I would like to understand this photo better.  (see my profile for e-mail info)  3 Swash', '2002-07-23 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
