(92653, 3598, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is ''ok''.  I think could be a little better.  To me, the white balance needs to be fixed - the white is too grey.  If the lighting is to stay somewhat dim, I think I would crop in closer.  Something is amiss here - it''s just not jumping out to me.  The focus is good and of course meets the challenge.  Still good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is ''ok''.  I think could be a little better.  To me, the white balance needs to be fixed - the white is too grey.  If the lighting is to stay somewhat dim, I think I would crop in closer.  Something is amiss here - it''s just not jumping out to me.  The focus is good and of course meets the challenge.  Still good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-25 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
