(92681, 3601, 2661, '<td valign="top">great idea for a texture, and I like the shapes and shadows. the one thing that bugs me is the reflections (at least, that''s what they look like. could be powdered sugar or something, for all I know). to get rid of that, you could try drying off the fruit better, or perhaps using a polarizing filter (though I''ve never heard of using one on fresh fruit, it just might work).</td>', 'great idea for a texture, and I like the shapes and shadows. the one thing that bugs me is the reflections (at least, that''s what they look like. could be powdered sugar or something, for all I know). to get rid of that, you could try drying off the fruit better, or perhaps using a polarizing filter (though I''ve never heard of using one on fresh fruit, it just might work).', '2002-07-22 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
