(92757, 3606, 1796, '<td valign="top">would gain a lot if it was in focus  -  I bet you get tons of this kind of comments. I still like the picture a lot, the grid structure reminds me of terraced rice fields. 5 beegee</td>', 'would gain a lot if it was in focus  -  I bet you get tons of this kind of comments. I still like the picture a lot, the grid structure reminds me of terraced rice fields. 5 beegee', '2002-07-22 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92758, 3606, 1759, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition and a very interesting leaf pattern. I think there is a problem with sharpness though. Some unsharp mask would help a lot with creating sharp edge detail.</td>', 'Not a bad composition and a very interesting leaf pattern. I think there is a problem with sharpness though. Some unsharp mask would help a lot with creating sharp edge detail.', '2002-07-22 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
