(92773, 3606, 1041, '<td valign="top">leaves make a great shot for texture, especially the underside of them.  what hurts your shot (in my opinion) is that it''s not in focus.  did you maybe get closer than your camera can focus at?  i do that a lot with mine and it always beeps as if it has focused and then i upload the photos and they are all unsharp... sigh. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'leaves make a great shot for texture, especially the underside of them.  what hurts your shot (in my opinion) is that it''s not in focus.  did you maybe get closer than your camera can focus at?  i do that a lot with mine and it always beeps as if it has focused and then i upload the photos and they are all unsharp... sigh. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-23 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92774, 3606, 280, '<td valign="top">lack of focus and contrast spoils what could have been a good photo.</td>', 'lack of focus and contrast spoils what could have been a good photo.', '2002-07-23 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92775, 3606, 2703, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The colors seem flat and it is a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I like the idea. The colors seem flat and it is a bit out of focus.', '2002-07-24 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92776, 3606, 2811, '<td valign="top">culd have focused in better</td>', 'culd have focused in better', '2002-07-24 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92777, 3606, 2667, '<td valign="top">the lack of sharpness does not work for me in this picture. it detracts from the nice texture that is present, but poorly rendered. i think this image would have worked much better as a black and white... in focus, of course.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...3<br/>Meets Challenge...4<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'the lack of sharpness does not work for me in this picture. it detracts from the nice texture that is present, but poorly rendered. i think this image would have worked much better as a black and white... in focus, of course.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...3Meets Challenge...4Overall...4', '2002-07-24 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92778, 3606, 741, '<td valign="top">Could have been so good!  This is very similar to a shot I wanted to do.  Lack of focus really lets it down.</td>', 'Could have been so good!  This is very similar to a shot I wanted to do.  Lack of focus really lets it down.', '2002-07-24 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92779, 3606, 641, '<td valign="top">Good texture, just needs to be  a little less blurry.</td>', 'Good texture, just needs to be  a little less blurry.', '2002-07-24 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92780, 3606, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition4<br/>Originality4<br/>Technical  Aspects3<br/>Meets Challenge6<br/>Total Score4<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Originality4Technical  Aspects3Meets Challenge6Total Score4For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92781, 3606, 2792, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry</td>', 'Kinda blurry', '2002-07-24 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92782, 3606, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up of the veins. Would have been better with a sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice close-up of the veins. Would have been better with a sharp focus.', '2002-07-25 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92783, 3606, 806, '<td valign="top">out of focus and bad lighting. Also, the stem could''ve gone from lower left corner to near the upper right corner to be more interesting.</td>', 'out of focus and bad lighting. Also, the stem could''ve gone from lower left corner to near the upper right corner to be more interesting.', '2002-07-25 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92784, 3606, 2370, '<td valign="top">out of focus, and underexposed.</td>', 'out of focus, and underexposed.', '2002-07-26 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92785, 3606, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but would prefer sharper focus to better show the relief of the smaller veins.</td>', 'I like the composition but would prefer sharper focus to better show the relief of the smaller veins.', '2002-07-26 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92786, 3606, 1944, '<td valign="top">Your leaf doesn''t appear sharp. Possibly you got too close for your camera to focus, or your shutter speed was a little slow. Macro requires a little more steadiness (or a tripod) because a small amount of camera movement is a larger precentage of the picture field.</td>', 'Your leaf doesn''t appear sharp. Possibly you got too close for your camera to focus, or your shutter speed was a little slow. Macro requires a little more steadiness (or a tripod) because a small amount of camera movement is a larger precentage of the picture field.', '2002-07-26 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92787, 3606, 121, '<td valign="top">Is this deliberate soft focus?</td>', 'Is this deliberate soft focus?', '2002-07-26 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92788, 3606, 2199, '<td valign="top">Your probably getting lots of comments about ''not in focus'', right? That''s my primary observation on how you could improve this image. You''ve found a great subject for texture, but you need a sharp focus to show that texture. I might also play with the position of the main stem; either move it a bit to the left, or try a few shots with it forming more of a diagonal into the photo.</td>', 'Your probably getting lots of comments about ''not in focus'', right? That''s my primary observation on how you could improve this image. You''ve found a great subject for texture, but you need a sharp focus to show that texture. I might also play with the position of the main stem; either move it a bit to the left, or try a few shots with it forming more of a diagonal into the photo.', '2002-07-27 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92789, 3606, 737, '<td valign="top">I think you could have improved this with brighter lighting and focus. If you meant to have a "soft focus", I don''t think it applies for a texture photo.</td>', 'I think you could have improved this with brighter lighting and focus. If you meant to have a "soft focus", I don''t think it applies for a texture photo.', '2002-07-27 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92790, 3606, 656, '<td valign="top">slightly out of focus/ too close for your camera I think.  Shadows are distracting at bottom and right too</td>', 'slightly out of focus/ too close for your camera I think.  Shadows are distracting at bottom and right too', '2002-07-28 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92791, 3607, 1792, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus might help show the distinctive textures better.</td>', 'Sharper focus might help show the distinctive textures better.', '2002-07-22 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92792, 3607, 2158, '<td valign="top">A bit flat.  Had you used side lighting, the texture would have shown more.</td>', 'A bit flat.  Had you used side lighting, the texture would have shown more.', '2002-07-22 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92793, 3607, 2094, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns and colors, but it seems like the focus could be a bit better.</td>', 'I like the patterns and colors, but it seems like the focus could be a bit better.', '2002-07-23 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
