(92800, 3607, 806, '<td valign="top">Good effort and idea. Either too despeckled or not sharpened enough - or equivalent. I played with this in photoshop. Recropped to eliminate the E-F-R symbol, sharpened, and saturated the blue some more. Played with the rotation too - sort made it interesting in a vertical - sort of the unexpected.</td>', 'Good effort and idea. Either too despeckled or not sharpened enough - or equivalent. I played with this in photoshop. Recropped to eliminate the E-F-R symbol, sharpened, and saturated the blue some more. Played with the rotation too - sort made it interesting in a vertical - sort of the unexpected.', '2002-07-26 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
