(92828, 3610, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Kind of hard to balance the lighting on metal isn''t it?</td>', 'Good photo.  Kind of hard to balance the lighting on metal isn''t it?', '2002-07-22 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92829, 3610, 327, '<td valign="top">Light is too hot here, must of been that background. Cool perspective all the same. Kee</td>', 'Light is too hot here, must of been that background. Cool perspective all the same. Kee', '2002-07-22 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92830, 3610, 1845, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-19 03:08:44.</i></td>', '.', '2002-07-22 15:50:00.000000', '2003-09-19 04:08:44.000000', 1),
(92831, 3610, 772, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle would have helped here... the quarters are only slightly off center... this is a bit distracting... maybe if you had centered and turnd this stack 45 degrees to the right, it would have punched a little harder... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think a different angle would have helped here... the quarters are only slightly off center... this is a bit distracting... maybe if you had centered and turnd this stack 45 degrees to the right, it would have punched a little harder... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-22 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92832, 3610, 1143, '<td valign="top">Light is too bright. Is the subject the quarters or background?</td>', 'Light is too bright. Is the subject the quarters or background?', '2002-07-22 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92833, 3610, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but your lighting is not that flattering to the coins.  You really captured some interesting textures!</td>', 'I like your idea, but your lighting is not that flattering to the coins.  You really captured some interesting textures!', '2002-07-22 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92834, 3610, 2200, '<td valign="top">flash should be positioned more to side and at angle so not to reflect directly into the lens</td>', 'flash should be positioned more to side and at angle so not to reflect directly into the lens', '2002-07-22 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92835, 3610, 2278, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very harsh - I can''t make out half of the Ohio quarter.</td>', 'Lighting is very harsh - I can''t make out half of the Ohio quarter.', '2002-07-22 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92836, 3610, 352, '<td valign="top">the flash is a bit harsh on the top quarter, could you have done this by opening your fstop, expanding your shutter speed, etc...</td>', 'the flash is a bit harsh on the top quarter, could you have done this by opening your fstop, expanding your shutter speed, etc...', '2002-07-23 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92837, 3610, 2888, '<td valign="top">hmm</td>', 'hmm', '2002-07-23 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92838, 3610, 1944, '<td valign="top">You have a good idea, but the background texture and the top coin is way too much over exposed.</td>', 'You have a good idea, but the background texture and the top coin is way too much over exposed.', '2002-07-24 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92839, 3610, 2907, '<td valign="top">poor lighting and off focus</td>', 'poor lighting and off focus', '2002-07-24 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92840, 3610, 1041, '<td valign="top">there''s a new take on texture that i didn''t think of, interesting.  quarters certainly do have texture.  the execution of the photo could be a little better, your file size is only 1/3 of what''s allowed and that shows in the pixelation.  the lighting is uneven (darker in the LL corner) and the shadow doesn''t add anything here.  maybe two light sources?  most of all, the photo isn''t quite sharp, and that''s pretty important for many textures. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'there''s a new take on texture that i didn''t think of, interesting.  quarters certainly do have texture.  the execution of the photo could be a little better, your file size is only 1/3 of what''s allowed and that shows in the pixelation.  the lighting is uneven (darker in the LL corner) and the shadow doesn''t add anything here.  maybe two light sources?  most of all, the photo isn''t quite sharp, and that''s pretty important for many textures. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-24 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92841, 3610, 2634, '<td valign="top">This is too light, lacks interest and is not properly focused. It is very pixelated, you might want to check into that.</td>', 'This is too light, lacks interest and is not properly focused. It is very pixelated, you might want to check into that.', '2002-07-24 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92842, 3610, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried for more even lighting (but probably not succeeded).</td>', 'I''d have tried for more even lighting (but probably not succeeded).', '2002-07-25 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92843, 3610, 2586, '<td valign="top">Not enough tonal contrast between the coins and the cloth. Top right is light and bottom left is dark; should have been the other way around, methinks. Coins are out of focus.</td>', 'Not enough tonal contrast between the coins and the cloth. Top right is light and bottom left is dark; should have been the other way around, methinks. Coins are out of focus.', '2002-07-25 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92844, 3610, 2158, '<td valign="top">You got too much light on the top coin.</td>', 'You got too much light on the top coin.', '2002-07-25 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92845, 3610, 1, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit, too much from the top, and too little on the bottom.  You need more DOF as well to make the upright quarter in focus.  Finally I would''ved rotated the quarters so they went from left to right to fill the frame more.</td>', 'Poorly lit, too much from the top, and too little on the bottom.  You need more DOF as well to make the upright quarter in focus.  Finally I would''ved rotated the quarters so they went from left to right to fill the frame more.', '2002-07-26 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92846, 3610, 1005, '<td valign="top">It could be the flash glare (too strong!), but it seems out of focus, too.  The shadow at the bottom of the frame...why?  Upright coin way out of focus, this needs a much wider depth of field.  South Carolina is hard to see, too.  Texture is there, of course, but not well demonstrated.  Sorry, but I convinced myself to lower your score from 6 to 5.  Swash</td>', 'It could be the flash glare (too strong!), but it seems out of focus, too.  The shadow at the bottom of the frame...why?  Upright coin way out of focus, this needs a much wider depth of field.  South Carolina is hard to see, too.  Texture is there, of course, but not well demonstrated.  Sorry, but I convinced myself to lower your score from 6 to 5.  Swash', '2002-07-26 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92847, 3610, 811, '<td valign="top">Reflective surfaces are soooooo hard to do well.  You have an awesome idea here, and the background, though busy, adds another layer of texture.  I think if you were to redo this shot, you should try it so that the light doesn''t cast a shadow over the lower quarter.  Maybe use two or three lights at different points so that shadows are eliminated.  Secondly, and this is just a thought, use Ohio and NC''s quarter because there have been "debates" over which is really the "First in Flight" state.   karmat</td>', 'Reflective surfaces are soooooo hard to do well.  You have an awesome idea here, and the background, though busy, adds another layer of texture.  I think if you were to redo this shot, you should try it so that the light doesn''t cast a shadow over the lower quarter.  Maybe use two or three lights at different points so that shadows are eliminated.  Secondly, and this is just a thought, use Ohio and NC''s quarter because there have been "debates" over which is really the "First in Flight" state.   karmat', '2002-07-26 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92848, 3610, 2337, '<td valign="top">Light sorce seems to harsh, the shadow hides the texture of the lower quarter while the glare burned out the texture for the top one.  The ridge would have been great, but it was outside the dof.  Nice concept though.</td>', 'Light sorce seems to harsh, the shadow hides the texture of the lower quarter while the glare burned out the texture for the top one.  The ridge would have been great, but it was outside the dof.  Nice concept though.', '2002-07-27 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92849, 3610, 737, '<td valign="top">Upper half a little bright for me.</td>', 'Upper half a little bright for me.', '2002-07-28 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92850, 3610, 2963, '<td valign="top">Wow how did he do that :S</td>', 'Wow how did he do that :S', '2002-07-28 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92851, 3611, 2661, '<td valign="top">good texture, and I like the diagonal lines running across the picture. it might be nice to have something besides pure texture, though.</td>', 'good texture, and I like the diagonal lines running across the picture. it might be nice to have something besides pure texture, though.', '2002-07-22 04:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92852, 3611, 2815, '<td valign="top">I had this exact ame idea.  I just never got the pcture taken.   great texture</td>', 'I had this exact ame idea.  I just never got the pcture taken.   great texture', '2002-07-22 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1);
