(92870, 3611, 749, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of B&amp;W, well lit, and an interesting composition. Gets a 9.<br/>- Manic -</td>', 'Perfect use of B&W, well lit, and an interesting composition. Gets a 9.- Manic -', '2002-07-25 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92871, 3611, 1066, '<td valign="top">I am one of the folks here that probably doesn''t go for the wallpaper, full frame photo of texture as much as a having a subject like a concrete filling a portion of the frame with depth of feild providing a background.  I realize this is personal preference.  That being said..I really like the diagonals here and think there is a tremendous potential in the subject...5..hokie</td>', 'I am one of the folks here that probably doesn''t go for the wallpaper, full frame photo of texture as much as a having a subject like a concrete filling a portion of the frame with depth of feild providing a background.  I realize this is personal preference.  That being said..I really like the diagonals here and think there is a tremendous potential in the subject...5..hokie', '2002-07-25 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92872, 3611, 1041, '<td valign="top">it''s textured all right.  it''s in focus and otherwise technically properly executed.  i like that you''ve put the stripes diagonal.  there''s just that little something missing for me to interrupt the monotony and hold the eye a little longer.  just not sure what that would be, some kind of other small object somewhere. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'it''s textured all right.  it''s in focus and otherwise technically properly executed.  i like that you''ve put the stripes diagonal.  there''s just that little something missing for me to interrupt the monotony and hold the eye a little longer.  just not sure what that would be, some kind of other small object somewhere. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-07-25 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92873, 3611, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellent - witty title too.  Great lines, focus, contrast, color - all great.  Perhaps not the most appealing subject, but you''ve done a great job of photographing it.  Well done!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Excellent - witty title too.  Great lines, focus, contrast, color - all great.  Perhaps not the most appealing subject, but you''ve done a great job of photographing it.  Well done!Ruthann', '2002-07-25 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(92874, 3611, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yup, you''re right, it cement!  Although the patterns could be considered interesting, personally I find this shot about as exciting as paint drying.  It''s a well taken shot.  Great focus, nice contrast with the shadows.  6 Swash</td>', 'Yup, you''re right, it cement!  Although the patterns could be considered interesting, personally I find this shot about as exciting as paint drying.  It''s a well taken shot.  Great focus, nice contrast with the shadows.  6 Swash', '2002-07-26 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
