(92897, 3613, 2079, '<td valign="top">I love this, as one of my top 3 for this challenge - it works so well in B/W.  I would love to see just a little more of the bottom half of the starfish.  Great piece of art. but what is under the starfish on the left side. It''s not distracting or offencive in any way but it bothers me that I can''t tell what it is. Good luck - Mike</td>', 'I love this, as one of my top 3 for this challenge - it works so well in B/W.  I would love to see just a little more of the bottom half of the starfish.  Great piece of art. but what is under the starfish on the left side. It''s not distracting or offencive in any way but it bothers me that I can''t tell what it is. Good luck - Mike', '2002-07-24 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
