(92904, 3613, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this shot in black and white.  I think if the really smooth shell on the far left (or it looks smooth) was between the starfish and the shell on the right, it would show the contrast of the textures even better.</td>', 'I like this shot in black and white.  I think if the really smooth shell on the far left (or it looks smooth) was between the starfish and the shell on the right, it would show the contrast of the textures even better.', '2002-07-29 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
