(92926, 3614, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I feel as if I should not walk there in bare feet as the earth has dried so hard and thin, it may be sharp.  The focus is great as well as the cropping.  One thing...what about a lower angle? - just a thought.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I feel as if I should not walk there in bare feet as the earth has dried so hard and thin, it may be sharp.  The focus is great as well as the cropping.  One thing...what about a lower angle? - just a thought.  9Ruthann', '2002-07-27 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
