(92928, 3615, 2638, '<td valign="top">I like that your picture actually has a subject.  I really like it.  If I was going to be picky, I''d try to do something about the shadow in the back, but I''m not that picky.  <br/>:-) rondajewel</td>', 'I like that your picture actually has a subject.  I really like it.  If I was going to be picky, I''d try to do something about the shadow in the back, but I''m not that picky.  :-) rondajewel', '2002-07-22 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
