(93051, 3625, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the elephants!  Texture well displayed.  Indian elephants are sooo different from African ones.  I don''t see any photographic flaws.  I started this shot out as a 6, but this is really more of an 8.  Swash</td>', 'Great shot of the elephants!  Texture well displayed.  Indian elephants are sooo different from African ones.  I don''t see any photographic flaws.  I started this shot out as a 6, but this is really more of an 8.  Swash', '2002-07-26 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
