(93115, 3628, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think using the rule of thirds would be more effective with the empty black space - I would crop out the left black space and some of the wrist (sometimes I try it while I''m voting - shrinking the screen so that only that portion shows - and I like it)  There is strong lines at the base of the thumb that really come out when the left is cropped closer - Just my opinion.  This is great work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Interesting.  I think using the rule of thirds would be more effective with the empty black space - I would crop out the left black space and some of the wrist (sometimes I try it while I''m voting - shrinking the screen so that only that portion shows - and I like it)  There is strong lines at the base of the thumb that really come out when the left is cropped closer - Just my opinion.  This is great work.Ruthann', '2002-07-25 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93116, 3628, 2560, '<td valign="top">I dont know how you did it and im guessing its legal.  I bet noone has said anything about that one little pixel.  To bad you cant just fix it for the contest.  cool shot.</td>', 'I dont know how you did it and im guessing its legal.  I bet noone has said anything about that one little pixel.  To bad you cant just fix it for the contest.  cool shot.', '2002-07-25 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
