(93160, 3630, 2079, '<td valign="top">Thanks very much myqyl, I knew I was going out on a limb with this entry - I suspected that many would not see as vivid of an interpretation of texture, simply because this photo is showing texture from a distance.  -Many are very literal in the way they interpret the challenges_  (I am very pleased with 11th place)  - Thank everyone for taking the time to comment. This photo was taken in the USA - at the very photogenic - Mission San Juan Capistrano, founded 1776 -</td>', 'Thanks very much myqyl, I knew I was going out on a limb with this entry - I suspected that many would not see as vivid of an interpretation of texture, simply because this photo is showing texture from a distance.  -Many are very literal in the way they interpret the challenges_  (I am very pleased with 11th place)  - Thank everyone for taking the time to comment. This photo was taken in the USA - at the very photogenic - Mission San Juan Capistrano, founded 1776 -', '2002-07-29 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(93161, 3631, 2586, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. However, I think some areas should have been cropped out: the little "step"? at top right and the yellow spot and two dark spots at top left. If you''re going for abstract, it should have been starker to make it more dramatic.</td>', 'Fun idea. However, I think some areas should have been cropped out: the little "step"? at top right and the yellow spot and two dark spots at top left. If you''re going for abstract, it should have been starker to make it more dramatic.', '2002-07-22 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
