(93213, 3633, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice texture :)  I like the clean execution on this one... The lighting is a little strong but it works well here.  The only thing I can see that *I* would like in this image is a stronger diagonal in the spaces between the rope.  They are not horizontal, but I think a little stronger diagonal here would add more impact in my own opinion... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice texture :)  I like the clean execution on this one... The lighting is a little strong but it works well here.  The only thing I can see that *I* would like in this image is a stronger diagonal in the spaces between the rope.  They are not horizontal, but I think a little stronger diagonal here would add more impact in my own opinion... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-26 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
