(93243, 3635, 1041, '<td valign="top">i like the colors (green being my fav, and blue a close 2nd) and the idea is good, too.  the left side of the shot seems a little OOF, did you have your camera set to a shallow DOF (if you can control the setting that is)? and maybe not quite level so that the left side was further away?  that is a little distracting to me, also, the left side seems a little darker, maybe add some more even lighting if that''s possible. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'i like the colors (green being my fav, and blue a close 2nd) and the idea is good, too.  the left side of the shot seems a little OOF, did you have your camera set to a shallow DOF (if you can control the setting that is)? and maybe not quite level so that the left side was further away?  that is a little distracting to me, also, the left side seems a little darker, maybe add some more even lighting if that''s possible. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-23 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93244, 3635, 1379, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors you got, and I''m curious about how you did this photo.  I''m guessing that''s a sheet of black plastic with colored light bounced onto it?  I can''t wait to read the info for this shot.  Very interesting.</td>', 'I really love the colors you got, and I''m curious about how you did this photo.  I''m guessing that''s a sheet of black plastic with colored light bounced onto it?  I can''t wait to read the info for this shot.  Very interesting.', '2002-07-23 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93245, 3635, 1944, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like the colors and the exposure, but it doesn''t seem as sharp as it should be to me.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like the colors and the exposure, but it doesn''t seem as sharp as it should be to me.', '2002-07-24 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93246, 3635, 573, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting material to be photographing for the Texture challenge, and I do not know what it is.  On second look though I am bumping it up a notch.</td>', 'This is an interesting material to be photographing for the Texture challenge, and I do not know what it is.  On second look though I am bumping it up a notch.', '2002-07-24 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
