(93284, 3638, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is one of many photos I have been bumping up a couple of points after adjusting my monitor.  What I saw as flaws were actually my monitor''s poor gamma setting.  goodbye 4, hello 6</td>', 'This is one of many photos I have been bumping up a couple of points after adjusting my monitor.  What I saw as flaws were actually my monitor''s poor gamma setting.  goodbye 4, hello 6', '2002-07-26 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
