(93287, 3638, 772, '<td valign="top">nice cat portrait :)  I like the composition on this one.. the vertical orientation works very well.  The texture of the cat''s fur stands out nicely.  In this image, a little extra sharpness may really make that fur punch a little harder :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice cat portrait :)  I like the composition on this one.. the vertical orientation works very well.  The texture of the cat''s fur stands out nicely.  In this image, a little extra sharpness may really make that fur punch a little harder :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-28 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93288, 3638, 1280, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments. Will work on sharpness, resolution, and other technical issues.  I''m so glad that a few of you identified with this photo of my Suma.   Suma is a major character (there are others)  in my days, and always so willing to freeze for the  moment.  And he is well rewarded!  :-) This pic was a moment after I hand-fed him a favorite treat, right here at my desk.  I used the built in flash and he was looking up at me and there it was.</td>', 'Thanks for all of your comments. Will work on sharpness, resolution, and other technical issues.  I''m so glad that a few of you identified with this photo of my Suma.   Suma is a major character (there are others)  in my days, and always so willing to freeze for the  moment.  And he is well rewarded!  :-) This pic was a moment after I hand-fed him a favorite treat, right here at my desk.  I used the built in flash and he was looking up at me and there it was.', '2002-07-29 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
