(93372, 3642, 811, '<td valign="top">this picture has a sense of movement to me.  I feel like I''m being drawn into it.   I think it may be cropped a little tightly on the left though.  karmat</td>', 'this picture has a sense of movement to me.  I feel like I''m being drawn into it.   I think it may be cropped a little tightly on the left though.  karmat', '2002-07-25 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93373, 3642, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wild effect you have going here.  The center of this shot almost seems to jump out at you (I think due to the focus of the bark (rusted metal?) around it.  This has both beauty and revultion at the same time.  I didn''t like it at first, but it grows on you.  Started as a 6, but will bump up to a 7.  Swash</td>', 'Wild effect you have going here.  The center of this shot almost seems to jump out at you (I think due to the focus of the bark (rusted metal?) around it.  This has both beauty and revultion at the same time.  I didn''t like it at first, but it grows on you.  Started as a 6, but will bump up to a 7.  Swash', '2002-07-26 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
