(93378, 3644, 889, '<td valign="top">WAY over compressed. Remeber you have a 150K file size limit your only using 1/5 of that and as a result compressing out most of your detail Do all of your photoediting as a tiff file converted from the jpg so that up until your final version so your not loosing image information with each save. Read the forums on hints and tricks. (And yes Ive learned the same thing the same way.) - rjhawkin</td>', 'WAY over compressed. Remeber you have a 150K file size limit your only using 1/5 of that and as a result compressing out most of your detail Do all of your photoediting as a tiff file converted from the jpg so that up until your final version so your not loosing image information with each save. Read the forums on hints and tricks. (And yes Ive learned the same thing the same way.) - rjhawkin', '2002-07-22 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
