(93388, 3644, 1796, '<td valign="top">I guess this suffers a lot from too much compression, i.e. would look a lot better if you went for more quality in the jpeg settings. The lack of focus would probably be less of an issue then, too. finally, I think there''s too much light in this shot, or the lighting is simply not balanced enough. 4 beegee</td>', 'I guess this suffers a lot from too much compression, i.e. would look a lot better if you went for more quality in the jpeg settings. The lack of focus would probably be less of an issue then, too. finally, I think there''s too much light in this shot, or the lighting is simply not balanced enough. 4 beegee', '2002-07-23 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
