(93483, 3649, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition10<br/>Originality10<br/>Technical  Aspects10<br/>Meets Challenge9<br/>Total Score10<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition10Originality10Technical  Aspects10Meets Challenge9Total Score10For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93484, 3649, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  DOF is perfect, lighting is perfect.</td>', 'Nicely done.  DOF is perfect, lighting is perfect.', '2002-07-24 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93485, 3649, 1003, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-07-24 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93486, 3649, 749, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I can''t help feeling that the lighting could have been a bit warmer, to pick up the colour of the strawberries a bit more. Gets an 8.<br/>- Manic -</td>', 'Nicely done, but I can''t help feeling that the lighting could have been a bit warmer, to pick up the colour of the strawberries a bit more. Gets an 8.- Manic -', '2002-07-25 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93487, 3649, 2154, '<td valign="top">this fills the requirements....very nice</td>', 'this fills the requirements....very nice', '2002-07-26 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93488, 3649, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer the strawberries a little lighter, but I like the way they show through the ice.</td>', 'I''d prefer the strawberries a little lighter, but I like the way they show through the ice.', '2002-07-27 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93489, 3649, 2564, '<td valign="top">Very cold and fresh.  I like it.  Especially in the summer.  Might have used brighter strawberries or played with lighting to brighten them.  The one on the right is kinda mashed.</td>', 'Very cold and fresh.  I like it.  Especially in the summer.  Might have used brighter strawberries or played with lighting to brighten them.  The one on the right is kinda mashed.', '2002-07-27 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93490, 3649, 2261, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but a little bit dark.  A little better light and the strawberries would look good enough to eat.</td>', 'Good composition, but a little bit dark.  A little better light and the strawberries would look good enough to eat.', '2002-07-27 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93491, 3649, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Only I think the lighting could be different, such as to put more emphasis on the strawberries instead of the ice behind it - just personal opinion.  I like the composition.  Definately creates the feeling of wanting a nice cool strawberry!!  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good photo.  Only I think the lighting could be different, such as to put more emphasis on the strawberries instead of the ice behind it - just personal opinion.  I like the composition.  Definately creates the feeling of wanting a nice cool strawberry!!  9Ruthann', '2002-07-27 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93492, 3649, 472, '<td valign="top">mmm, tempting and appetizing ... could be a shot in a magazine.  light and arrangement are that good.</td>', 'mmm, tempting and appetizing ... could be a shot in a magazine.  light and arrangement are that good.', '2002-07-27 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93493, 3649, 656, '<td valign="top">great - want to taste them...  very effective.  Reds are a little bit dark though.</td>', 'great - want to taste them...  very effective.  Reds are a little bit dark though.', '2002-07-28 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93494, 3651, 772, '<td valign="top">good texture, but the image is not inspiring me. = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'good texture, but the image is not inspiring me. = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-22 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93495, 3651, 2553, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like to have seen more contrast in this photo.</td>', 'I think I would have like to have seen more contrast in this photo.', '2002-07-22 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93496, 3651, 1041, '<td valign="top">straw and leaves, actually.  while this meets the texture challenge, it''s simply not a very interesting shot to me.  there''s no central point and it''s too much tone in tone.  sorry. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'straw and leaves, actually.  while this meets the texture challenge, it''s simply not a very interesting shot to me.  there''s no central point and it''s too much tone in tone.  sorry. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-22 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93497, 3651, 2278, '<td valign="top">I believe they''re actually pine needles, aren''t they?  I think maybe some depth would help this picture a lot - a different perspective instead of straight down.</td>', 'I believe they''re actually pine needles, aren''t they?  I think maybe some depth would help this picture a lot - a different perspective instead of straight down.', '2002-07-22 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93498, 3651, 72, '<td valign="top">Very jackson pollack meets jolly green giant.  I love the muted colors in the straw and leaves!</td>', 'Very jackson pollack meets jolly green giant.  I love the muted colors in the straw and leaves!', '2002-07-23 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93499, 3651, 640, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice to have some kind of contrasting color maybe</td>', 'Would have been nice to have some kind of contrasting color maybe', '2002-07-23 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93500, 3651, 2798, '<td valign="top">Too dark - too flat.</td>', 'Too dark - too flat.', '2002-07-23 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93501, 3651, 472, '<td valign="top">i think a sideways light angle could haveb brought this texture more to life</td>', 'i think a sideways light angle could haveb brought this texture more to life', '2002-07-23 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93502, 3651, 436, '<td valign="top">without a secondary light source, this potentially cool image falls flat.  Spend a little more time with the lighting and angle. Drop something interesting in one corner and you''ll have a nicer shot.</td>', 'without a secondary light source, this potentially cool image falls flat.  Spend a little more time with the lighting and angle. Drop something interesting in one corner and you''ll have a nicer shot.', '2002-07-24 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93503, 3651, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition4<br/>Originality6<br/>Technical  Aspects4<br/>Meets Challenge5<br/>Total Score5<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Originality6Technical  Aspects4Meets Challenge5Total Score5For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93504, 3651, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is nice but lacks visual impact for me. It becomes a little monotonous and needed something else to give it tension or some juxtaposition.</td>', 'This is nice but lacks visual impact for me. It becomes a little monotonous and needed something else to give it tension or some juxtaposition.', '2002-07-25 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93505, 3651, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a fine photo of straw.  It does fit the challenge, but there are few more considerations than just those two.  Two more would be:  Would I want this photo hanging on my wall? (nice/interesting to look at) Honestly no, I wouldn''t.  Second is my guess at your level of effort.  Let''s just say you creatively hid a message in the straw, like I love my wife, yada, yada, yada, whatever.  From all appearances, you walked up to this patch of straw, and shot.  Finally, the shot is a bit overly dark overall.  If this was to convey some sort of message, I missed it. <br/>5 Swash</td>', 'This is a fine photo of straw.  It does fit the challenge, but there are few more considerations than just those two.  Two more would be:  Would I want this photo hanging on my wall? (nice/interesting to look at) Honestly no, I wouldn''t.  Second is my guess at your level of effort.  Let''s just say you creatively hid a message in the straw, like I love my wife, yada, yada, yada, whatever.  From all appearances, you walked up to this patch of straw, and shot.  Finally, the shot is a bit overly dark overall.  If this was to convey some sort of message, I missed it. 5 Swash', '2002-07-25 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93506, 3651, 811, '<td valign="top">This is very well in focus.  I think a lower camera perspective would give it more depth, and it would also serve as a good background for something with a smooth texture and bright color. karmat</td>', 'This is very well in focus.  I think a lower camera perspective would give it more depth, and it would also serve as a good background for something with a smooth texture and bright color. karmat', '2002-07-25 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93507, 3651, 824, '<td valign="top">Nice color, random design. meets the criteria of the challenge, but it could have been a little more creative.</td>', 'Nice color, random design. meets the criteria of the challenge, but it could have been a little more creative.', '2002-07-27 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93508, 3651, 1019, '<td valign="top">A bit flat for me but good focus</td>', 'A bit flat for me but good focus', '2002-07-27 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93509, 3651, 637, '<td valign="top">Little dark and uninteresting in my opinion... Could use something else amidst the straw.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'Little dark and uninteresting in my opinion... Could use something else amidst the straw.  4 sjgleah', '2002-07-27 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93510, 3653, 2370, '<td valign="top">interesting, how did u manage to get the sand dunes effect? =)</td>', 'interesting, how did u manage to get the sand dunes effect? =)', '2002-07-22 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
