(93513, 3653, 327, '<td valign="top">This sugar looks grey, I wouldn''t of know what it was. Very cool looking texture all the same. Kee</td>', 'This sugar looks grey, I wouldn''t of know what it was. Very cool looking texture all the same. Kee', '2002-07-22 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93514, 3653, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the abstract image you created. Don''t see any texture though and if these dunes are made of sugar shouldn''t there be more white besides the few specks of white that read like noise</td>', 'Like the abstract image you created. Don''t see any texture though and if these dunes are made of sugar shouldn''t there be more white besides the few specks of white that read like noise', '2002-07-22 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93515, 3653, 121, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot but could have been much improved in post production. Using Photoshop or similar adjusting the levels to make the sugar whiter and then playing with brightness and contrast makes a huge difference. I saved your image and tried it and it makes a huge difference. It looks fantastic with a black background instead of red and converted to greyscale is very cool.  I do like the shot though. You will probably like your shot better but take a look at it the way I worked it //uk.photos.yahoo.com/bc/martinwoods_uk/lst?.dir=/Yahoo!+Photo+Album&amp;.view=t</td>', 'This is a good shot but could have been much improved in post production. Using Photoshop or similar adjusting the levels to make the sugar whiter and then playing with brightness and contrast makes a huge difference. I saved your image and tried it and it makes a huge difference. It looks fantastic with a black background instead of red and converted to greyscale is very cool.  I do like the shot though. You will probably like your shot better but take a look at it the way I worked it //uk.photos.yahoo.com/bc/martinwoods_uk/lst?.dir=/Yahoo!+Photo+Album&.view=t', '2002-07-22 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
