(93561, 3655, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of ''soft focus'' and I understand it is sometimes used on purpose and folks don''t get it... But this shot loses alot from the soft focus.  For the texture to leap out, you ''need'' the sharpest focus you could get.  Of course, that''s just me :)  Great idea/</td>', 'I''m a big fan of ''soft focus'' and I understand it is sometimes used on purpose and folks don''t get it... But this shot loses alot from the soft focus.  For the texture to leap out, you ''need'' the sharpest focus you could get.  Of course, that''s just me :)  Great idea/', '2002-07-22 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
