(93566, 3655, 1041, '<td valign="top">wood like that is perfect for this challenge.  i also like that you found a piece of wood with an eye in it.  i probably would''ve placed the eye fully into the photo (while still following the ROT as you did).  what really hurts your shot is that it''s out of focus, and to be able to view the texture, focus is really important. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'wood like that is perfect for this challenge.  i also like that you found a piece of wood with an eye in it.  i probably would''ve placed the eye fully into the photo (while still following the ROT as you did).  what really hurts your shot is that it''s out of focus, and to be able to view the texture, focus is really important. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-22 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
