(93582, 3655, 1796, '<td valign="top">I''ll try to make this comment a little more useful than the average "lack of focus"... I looked at the size of your file and saw that you''re way below the allowed 150KB. to get better definition out of a shot, try to compress it less, when you save the resized image  -  if you don''t know how, drop me a line or post to the forums. this will not save a shot that is out of focus but if you start out with a crisp image, this helps to keep it that way. 3 beegee</td>', 'I''ll try to make this comment a little more useful than the average "lack of focus"... I looked at the size of your file and saw that you''re way below the allowed 150KB. to get better definition out of a shot, try to compress it less, when you save the resized image  -  if you don''t know how, drop me a line or post to the forums. this will not save a shot that is out of focus but if you start out with a crisp image, this helps to keep it that way. 3 beegee', '2002-07-24 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
