(93586, 3655, 2667, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft for me. a tripod, or making sure your cameras macro function is on, or a faster shutter speed and samller aperture (you dont need much depth of field here) would all improve the sharpness. however, i do like the composition and would have liked to see a bit more of the knot.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...4<br/>Meets Challenge...5<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'focus is too soft for me. a tripod, or making sure your cameras macro function is on, or a faster shutter speed and samller aperture (you dont need much depth of field here) would all improve the sharpness. however, i do like the composition and would have liked to see a bit more of the knot.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...4Meets Challenge...5Overall...4', '2002-07-24 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
