(93619, 3657, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice texture and very nice depth of field as well... my only critique on this image is a personal preference that I have learned from my camera club competitions... for me, odd numbers of subjects seem to work better than even numbers... in this composition, I believe that an arrangement of 3 flowers has more impact than 4, but is'' just a preference thing.  = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice texture and very nice depth of field as well... my only critique on this image is a personal preference that I have learned from my camera club competitions... for me, odd numbers of subjects seem to work better than even numbers... in this composition, I believe that an arrangement of 3 flowers has more impact than 4, but is'' just a preference thing.  = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-28 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
