(93657, 3660, 2907, '<td valign="top">Where is the texture?? OK, composition, focus and lighting.. pitty about the dust the pacaging lid. Don''t know  what the situation is in the photo but part of photography is pushing the limits.. so clean them with your tee-shirt if you have too :-) Sorry, But I think you missed the theme.</td>', 'Where is the texture?? OK, composition, focus and lighting.. pitty about the dust the pacaging lid. Don''t know  what the situation is in the photo but part of photography is pushing the limits.. so clean them with your tee-shirt if you have too :-) Sorry, But I think you missed the theme.', '2002-07-26 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
