(93694, 3662, 2221, '<td valign="top">I was pretty shocked when seeing the first two comments. I wasn''t aware of the photo in the Games challenge. However, I think I would have submitted anyways when knowing in advance.<br/><br/>The glare on the scissors was intended. I wanted to show the cool, gleaming metal in contrast to the plain paper and the fractured rock. Actually the glare was what made me to submit this photo.<br/><br/>Thanks to all for your comments.<br/><br/></td>', 'I was pretty shocked when seeing the first two comments. I wasn''t aware of the photo in the Games challenge. However, I think I would have submitted anyways when knowing in advance.The glare on the scissors was intended. I wanted to show the cool, gleaming metal in contrast to the plain paper and the fractured rock. Actually the glare was what made me to submit this photo.Thanks to all for your comments.', '2002-07-29 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
