(93729, 3666, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the idea.  I also think it would have been really cool if the one on the right was a bleached blond or something, to provide even more contrast. karmat</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the idea.  I also think it would have been really cool if the one on the right was a bleached blond or something, to provide even more contrast. karmat', '2002-07-22 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93730, 3666, 1644, '<td valign="top">This was creative. I think it would also look good if there was more texture to the hair. Looks like you used a flash that made quite a glare. Maybe more diffuse lighting without loosing the detail?</td>', 'This was creative. I think it would also look good if there was more texture to the hair. Looks like you used a flash that made quite a glare. Maybe more diffuse lighting without loosing the detail?', '2002-07-22 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93731, 3666, 2661, '<td valign="top">a great idea, but needs something more, something to give it more interest. the image is composed entirely of vertical lines, which gets tiring to look at, so a different composition could help a lot. also, your flash kind of killed the texture. try lighting from the side instead of straight on.</td>', 'a great idea, but needs something more, something to give it more interest. the image is composed entirely of vertical lines, which gets tiring to look at, so a different composition could help a lot. also, your flash kind of killed the texture. try lighting from the side instead of straight on.', '2002-07-23 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93732, 3666, 2777, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if ponny tails are closer to each other and photo is closed up on them.</td>', 'I think it would be better if ponny tails are closer to each other and photo is closed up on them.', '2002-07-23 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93733, 3666, 2123, '<td valign="top">That''s great!  Very creative  7</td>', 'That''s great!  Very creative  7', '2002-07-23 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93734, 3666, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this shot.  Reminds me of a hair coloring commercial.  The only reason I didn''t give you a 10 was the black hair, at the top and bottom is sooo black, definition is lost.  I''m guessing, but I think a flash was used to create the lighting, strong diffused light would have shown the black more, then flash it to give your accent.  I really like the mixed braid, especially the strand of black and brown hair.   Guess you figured it out, you got a 9, Swash</td>', 'I really like the concept of this shot.  Reminds me of a hair coloring commercial.  The only reason I didn''t give you a 10 was the black hair, at the top and bottom is sooo black, definition is lost.  I''m guessing, but I think a flash was used to create the lighting, strong diffused light would have shown the black more, then flash it to give your accent.  I really like the mixed braid, especially the strand of black and brown hair.   Guess you figured it out, you got a 9, Swash', '2002-07-23 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93735, 3666, 1041, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful idea!  have you considered sending your shot to bennetton?  they might be interested!  i certainly have this in my top 5 list and will add it to my favorites when the voting is over. -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'this is a wonderful idea!  have you considered sending your shot to bennetton?  they might be interested!  i certainly have this in my top 5 list and will add it to my favorites when the voting is over. -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-07-24 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93736, 3666, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very good picture. I like your idea and the way you carried it out. One idea I had would be to position the brown braid against the black background and the black braid in front of the brown, but I like your way of doing it also.</td>', 'Very good picture. I like your idea and the way you carried it out. One idea I had would be to position the brown braid against the black background and the black braid in front of the brown, but I like your way of doing it also.', '2002-07-25 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93737, 3666, 2344, '<td valign="top">That is a very interesting idea! A nice transition of colours and textures!</td>', 'That is a very interesting idea! A nice transition of colours and textures!', '2002-07-25 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93738, 3666, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting lesson in how difficult it can be to photograph textures in black... this image looks good, but the lighting has caused a lot of detail washout in the black hair.  I also think the perfectly vertical braids could possibly make a higher impact on the viewer if they were diagonal in the frame... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting lesson in how difficult it can be to photograph textures in black... this image looks good, but the lighting has caused a lot of detail washout in the black hair.  I also think the perfectly vertical braids could possibly make a higher impact on the viewer if they were diagonal in the frame... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-25 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93739, 3666, 637, '<td valign="top">Funny, but I''d like it to be sharper ... 4 sjgleah</td>', 'Funny, but I''d like it to be sharper ... 4 sjgleah', '2002-07-27 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93740, 3666, 2564, '<td valign="top">Neat-o!  Although I would have probably eliminated the two side braids.  The point is made well enough with the center one, and it would have made the black and brown hair more touchable.  Maybe zoom in closer...</td>', 'Neat-o!  Although I would have probably eliminated the two side braids.  The point is made well enough with the center one, and it would have made the black and brown hair more touchable.  Maybe zoom in closer...', '2002-07-27 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93741, 3666, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!  I almost did hair too, but never thought up braiding two together! Fits the challege well.  Good job!</td>', 'Very creative idea!  I almost did hair too, but never thought up braiding two together! Fits the challege well.  Good job!', '2002-07-27 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
