(93743, 3666, 1041, '<td valign="top">i can''t believe you rated that low.  this was one of my very top votes!</td>', 'i can''t believe you rated that low.  this was one of my very top votes!', '2002-07-29 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(93744, 3666, 2472, '<td valign="top">I appreciate very much all the good and helpful comments I received this week. I have to confess I was baffled at the results I obtained with my entry this last week. I honestly didn''t entertain the illusion as a real possibility of ending in the top 10, but I do not understand ending this low in the list, trying hard to be objective about the other pictures presented. With my previous submissions I considered the results acceptable, even a little surprising in one of them, but for me the voting process and criteria applied has become an utter mystery. Quite discouraging, at first. I''ll leave this behind me for now and wait for this week''s results.<br/><br/>Thank you gr8photos for your supporting comment, what can I say? I absolutely agree with you... :)</td>', 'I appreciate very much all the good and helpful comments I received this week. I have to confess I was baffled at the results I obtained with my entry this last week. I honestly didn''t entertain the illusion as a real possibility of ending in the top 10, but I do not understand ending this low in the list, trying hard to be objective about the other pictures presented. With my previous submissions I considered the results acceptable, even a little surprising in one of them, but for me the voting process and criteria applied has become an utter mystery. Quite discouraging, at first. I''ll leave this behind me for now and wait for this week''s results.Thank you gr8photos for your supporting comment, what can I say? I absolutely agree with you... :)', '2002-07-29 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(93745, 3666, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am so disappointed that you didn''t place much higher.  I love this image, and it is definitely one of my favorites.</td>', 'I am so disappointed that you didn''t place much higher.  I love this image, and it is definitely one of my favorites.', '2002-07-29 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
