(93789, 3669, 772, '<td valign="top">This is great... the lighting and shadows cast on this cactus are quite nice... my only critique on this image is that I would have preferred to see a little less darkness across the bottom of the frame.  I think that a slightly higher camera angle would have made two improvements here... first, it would have removed the dark band across the bottom of the frame... secondly, it would have kept the top of the cactus from being so close to the top edge of the frame.  It is a little too close for comfort at the top... a little breathing room there would be nice :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is great... the lighting and shadows cast on this cactus are quite nice... my only critique on this image is that I would have preferred to see a little less darkness across the bottom of the frame.  I think that a slightly higher camera angle would have made two improvements here... first, it would have removed the dark band across the bottom of the frame... secondly, it would have kept the top of the cactus from being so close to the top edge of the frame.  It is a little too close for comfort at the top... a little breathing room there would be nice :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
