(93883, 3678, 878, '<td valign="top">The subject is a little confusing.  I thought Big Ben was a clock tower.  I do like the texture of this shot.</td>', 'The subject is a little confusing.  I thought Big Ben was a clock tower.  I do like the texture of this shot.', '2002-07-23 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93884, 3678, 2798, '<td valign="top">But it''s not Big Ben...</td>', 'But it''s not Big Ben...', '2002-07-23 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93885, 3678, 1041, '<td valign="top">interesting idea for texture.  two things that i would''ve considered changing to make it a tad more interesting (imo): play around with the colors to increase the contrast a little bit.  right now, the colors look a little flat to me.  i would also maybe have taken out a couple of the pieces so that it''s not just a jigsaw puzzle, but a puzzle in progress ... just a thought. i''m curious, why is it called big ben? -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'interesting idea for texture.  two things that i would''ve considered changing to make it a tad more interesting (imo): play around with the colors to increase the contrast a little bit.  right now, the colors look a little flat to me.  i would also maybe have taken out a couple of the pieces so that it''s not just a jigsaw puzzle, but a puzzle in progress ... just a thought. i''m curious, why is it called big ben? -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-23 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93886, 3678, 1897, '<td valign="top">This idea does not appeal to me at all.  Very weak image.</td>', 'This idea does not appeal to me at all.  Very weak image.', '2002-07-23 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93887, 3678, 1880, '<td valign="top">In Focus - 9, Lighting - 6, Color Levels - 7, DOF - 7 , Interesting Composition - 3, Interesting  Subject - 3 &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;  Tech Scores = 7, Subject Scores = 3, Final Score = 5, RLS</td>', 'In Focus - 9, Lighting - 6, Color Levels - 7, DOF - 7 , Interesting Composition - 3, Interesting  Subject - 3 &gt;&gt;&gt;  Tech Scores = 7, Subject Scores = 3, Final Score = 5, RLS', '2002-07-24 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93888, 3678, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a relatively difficult subject (pictures often give the worst glare).  Texture, I get it, the puzzle pieces.  I often gripe about the use of other''s art, this is no exception.  Ignore me, if you choose.  Besides assembling the pieces, how did you make this art YOURS?  I started you with a 5, my I don''t know what to score vote, but have talked myself down to a 4. Swash<br/>Addendum:  Suggestion  -  don''t complete the puzzle, leave a corner unfinished, lay some of the pieces left over in that open area and maybe even on top of the puzzle and you would have introduced YOUR art into this shot.  ;)</td>', 'Nice capture of a relatively difficult subject (pictures often give the worst glare).  Texture, I get it, the puzzle pieces.  I often gripe about the use of other''s art, this is no exception.  Ignore me, if you choose.  Besides assembling the pieces, how did you make this art YOURS?  I started you with a 5, my I don''t know what to score vote, but have talked myself down to a 4. SwashAddendum:  Suggestion  -  don''t complete the puzzle, leave a corner unfinished, lay some of the pieces left over in that open area and maybe even on top of the puzzle and you would have introduced YOUR art into this shot.  ;)', '2002-07-24 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
