(93897, 3679, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty but I believe the composition could of been better it the light was better. It''s a nice clear shot and it''s got textue. Kee</td>', 'Pretty but I believe the composition could of been better it the light was better. It''s a nice clear shot and it''s got textue. Kee', '2002-07-22 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93898, 3679, 1, '<td valign="top">From this angle, the texture really isn''t shown well.  Try flipping the shell over.</td>', 'From this angle, the texture really isn''t shown well.  Try flipping the shell over.', '2002-07-22 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93899, 3679, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice contrasts with black background, smooth and rough textures</td>', 'nice contrasts with black background, smooth and rough textures', '2002-07-22 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93900, 3679, 1759, '<td valign="top">beautiful piece! Very good job on lighting. The shadows are minimal, yet there is excellent depth. I also note a tack sharp focus throughout. Well done.</td>', 'beautiful piece! Very good job on lighting. The shadows are minimal, yet there is excellent depth. I also note a tack sharp focus throughout. Well done.', '2002-07-22 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93901, 3679, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simple set up.  The lighting works well too.  karmat</td>', 'I like the simple set up.  The lighting works well too.  karmat', '2002-07-23 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93902, 3679, 641, '<td valign="top">wow.. good shot. Love the lighting and colors.</td>', 'wow.. good shot. Love the lighting and colors.', '2002-07-24 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93903, 3679, 2204, '<td valign="top">I DO see texture here but, it seems to be more a photo representing "contrast".</td>', 'I DO see texture here but, it seems to be more a photo representing "contrast".', '2002-07-24 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93904, 3679, 308, '<td valign="top">The shell looks great - excellent detail and sharp.  I like that.  I think it would have looked better if there was some sort of texture in the background, as well.  Maybe on sand or something that wouldn''t overpower the shell itself.  But the fact that you got the background so dark and sharp is very impressive.</td>', 'The shell looks great - excellent detail and sharp.  I like that.  I think it would have looked better if there was some sort of texture in the background, as well.  Maybe on sand or something that wouldn''t overpower the shell itself.  But the fact that you got the background so dark and sharp is very impressive.', '2002-07-24 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93905, 3679, 2667, '<td valign="top">very nice, i love that floating through space feeling...   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge...8<br/>Overall...8</td>', 'very nice, i love that floating through space feeling...   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge...8Overall...8', '2002-07-25 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93906, 3679, 1707, '<td valign="top">hard as a rock expect inside...</td>', 'hard as a rock expect inside...', '2002-07-25 05:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93907, 3679, 671, '<td valign="top">Nice choice!  Great idea for this challenge, excellent lighting.</td>', 'Nice choice!  Great idea for this challenge, excellent lighting.', '2002-07-25 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93908, 3679, 772, '<td valign="top">this is definitely interesting texture.  I think the shell is slightly over exposed... the lighting is a little overpowering and it is creating a few harsh shadows as well.  This particular photo may be an example of where some minor diffusion of the flash would be helpful.  You can accomplish this by trying things like bouncing the flash off the ceiling if your flash tilts... if not, you could tape a small piece of tissue paper over the flash... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is definitely interesting texture.  I think the shell is slightly over exposed... the lighting is a little overpowering and it is creating a few harsh shadows as well.  This particular photo may be an example of where some minor diffusion of the flash would be helpful.  You can accomplish this by trying things like bouncing the flash off the ceiling if your flash tilts... if not, you could tape a small piece of tissue paper over the flash... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-26 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93909, 3679, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the rough outer shell, and how smooth it is inside.  Great colors as well.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the rough outer shell, and how smooth it is inside.  Great colors as well.', '2002-07-26 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93910, 3679, 1005, '<td valign="top">Plain, simple, well done.  I don''t see any "flaws" in this shot.  Textures are well displayed.  The pink/white/black contrast is very nice.  Low "excitement" shot.  On the good side, I talked you up from a 6 to a 7!  Swash</td>', 'Plain, simple, well done.  I don''t see any "flaws" in this shot.  Textures are well displayed.  The pink/white/black contrast is very nice.  Low "excitement" shot.  On the good side, I talked you up from a 6 to a 7!  Swash', '2002-07-26 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93911, 3679, 1831, '<td valign="top">Nice use of Black space "7" Dogman ;-)</td>', 'Nice use of Black space "7" Dogman ;-)', '2002-07-27 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
