(93936, 3682, 2172, '<td valign="top">I think this is great!  Very well done.  I think it may be a tad dark (foreground), but I like it.  GREAT job! 10 from me - I would hang this up.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I think this is great!  Very well done.  I think it may be a tad dark (foreground), but I like it.  GREAT job! 10 from me - I would hang this up.Ruthann', '2002-07-26 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93937, 3682, 121, '<td valign="top">The flower looks dull. I tried adjusting the levels in Photoshop and found that brightening the image this way gives the petals a translucent look, you can see the light coming through them. I don''t think it matters that the background becomes very bright as well. As it stands it''s a good pic but a bit dull and flat which can be fixed easily</td>', 'The flower looks dull. I tried adjusting the levels in Photoshop and found that brightening the image this way gives the petals a translucent look, you can see the light coming through them. I don''t think it matters that the background becomes very bright as well. As it stands it''s a good pic but a bit dull and flat which can be fixed easily', '2002-07-26 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(93938, 3682, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice photo... the texture in the center of the sunflower works very well... I think a fill flash would possibly accent that texture quite a bit as well :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a very nice photo... the texture in the center of the sunflower works very well... I think a fill flash would possibly accent that texture quite a bit as well :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-28 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
