(93942, 3683, 2783, '<td valign="top">You DEFINANTLY got the texture part down...but...what am I looking at? This is the first time that I simply can''t figure out what the picture is of. Luckly for you, I don''t think that it would be right to vote you down on this, because hey, It  does have texture! And I ''think'' the color is pretty good, too. (It would be a hell of a lot easier to tell that if I knew what it was). Although I don''t know what you photographed, I''m still going to give you a 7 just for the texture part<br/><br/>Nswenson0  (I typed way too much on this one)</td>', 'You DEFINANTLY got the texture part down...but...what am I looking at? This is the first time that I simply can''t figure out what the picture is of. Luckly for you, I don''t think that it would be right to vote you down on this, because hey, It  does have texture! And I ''think'' the color is pretty good, too. (It would be a hell of a lot easier to tell that if I knew what it was). Although I don''t know what you photographed, I''m still going to give you a 7 just for the texture partNswenson0  (I typed way too much on this one)', '2002-07-23 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
