(93952, 3683, 2586, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say that I''m really surprised this image didn''t do better. Even now that I can see it''s a palm tree, I find it very beautiful and interesting. What might have hurt you here is the title: perhaps it confused people. I didn''t understand the title either but just ignored it (pictures should stand on their own anyway). <br/>May I also thank you profusely for the update that you added to your comment on my pic. That really made me feel very good and I appreciated the effort you made there!</td>', 'Just wanted to say that I''m really surprised this image didn''t do better. Even now that I can see it''s a palm tree, I find it very beautiful and interesting. What might have hurt you here is the title: perhaps it confused people. I didn''t understand the title either but just ignored it (pictures should stand on their own anyway). May I also thank you profusely for the update that you added to your comment on my pic. That really made me feel very good and I appreciated the effort you made there!', '2002-07-29 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(93953, 3683, 2337, '<td valign="top">Thanks Journey.  All of my votes needed reworking after adjusting the calibration on my monitor.  And I started liking my own shot less... I should have pushed the saturation higher I think.<br/><br/>JMSetzler,  I tried it vertical, but my wife pointed out that it resembled a, ummm, welll, part of the female anatomy...</td>', 'Thanks Journey.  All of my votes needed reworking after adjusting the calibration on my monitor.  And I started liking my own shot less... I should have pushed the saturation higher I think.JMSetzler,  I tried it vertical, but my wife pointed out that it resembled a, ummm, welll, part of the female anatomy...', '2002-07-29 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
