(94030, 3690, 1041, '<td valign="top">good idea for texture.  the framing has a couple of distracting items in it (the blades of grass sticking up behind the mushroom, and the grass at the bottom (i would''ve tried to crop a little higher to eliminate that, or maybe a portrait format just on one of the mushrooms?  the top of the mushroom is also a little blown out with the light.  does your camera allow spotmetering?  or other manual controls that would allow you to bracket a shot and then pick the best one? -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'good idea for texture.  the framing has a couple of distracting items in it (the blades of grass sticking up behind the mushroom, and the grass at the bottom (i would''ve tried to crop a little higher to eliminate that, or maybe a portrait format just on one of the mushrooms?  the top of the mushroom is also a little blown out with the light.  does your camera allow spotmetering?  or other manual controls that would allow you to bracket a shot and then pick the best one? -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-25 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
