(94042, 3691, 72, '<td valign="top">Cool framing, and the aperature is perfect for this shot!</td>', 'Cool framing, and the aperature is perfect for this shot!', '2002-07-23 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94043, 3691, 2719, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition</td>', 'Interesting composition', '2002-07-23 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94044, 3691, 2661, '<td valign="top">good texture, good colors, good composition. I don''t know what I would do to improve this shot.</td>', 'good texture, good colors, good composition. I don''t know what I would do to improve this shot.', '2002-07-23 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94045, 3691, 2858, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-07-23 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94046, 3691, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2002-07-23 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94047, 3691, 772, '<td valign="top">This texture shot is quite nice.. I love the diagonal.  The only thing i don''t like about the image is the bright subjects that are visible in this hole.. maybe this is some of the pier supports... I know you had no control over that either... the level of brightness in there is much brighter than any other part of the image.. this being the case, it is a bit of a distraction and it does draw my attention away from the beautiful texture of the wood around this hole... still scores well.. = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This texture shot is quite nice.. I love the diagonal.  The only thing i don''t like about the image is the bright subjects that are visible in this hole.. maybe this is some of the pier supports... I know you had no control over that either... the level of brightness in there is much brighter than any other part of the image.. this being the case, it is a bit of a distraction and it does draw my attention away from the beautiful texture of the wood around this hole... still scores well.. = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94048, 3691, 573, '<td valign="top">Looks like it would be too far down for me to get that close.  Just out of curiosity, why did you pick this particular aspect ratio?  One of my top ten picks.</td>', 'Looks like it would be too far down for me to get that close.  Just out of curiosity, why did you pick this particular aspect ratio?  One of my top ten picks.', '2002-07-24 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94049, 3691, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition6<br/>Originality9<br/>Technical  Aspects5<br/>Meets Challenge5<br/>Total Score6<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Originality9Technical  Aspects5Meets Challenge5Total Score6For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94050, 3691, 2667, '<td valign="top">this looks great in black and white--try it! it is a nice shot. The white diagonal beneath the knothole is distracting to me, but the image is well done. ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...8<br/>Meets Challenge....9<br/>Overall...8</td>', 'this looks great in black and white--try it! it is a nice shot. The white diagonal beneath the knothole is distracting to me, but the image is well done. ~mcmurmaAesthetics...8Meets Challenge....9Overall...8', '2002-07-25 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94051, 3691, 671, '<td valign="top">great framing, choice of subject.  Lighting works well.  8</td>', 'great framing, choice of subject.  Lighting works well.  8', '2002-07-25 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94052, 3691, 2312, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, crisp shot. I like how the knothole leads your eye down below. *6* -balynch</td>', 'This is a nice, crisp shot. I like how the knothole leads your eye down below. *6* -balynch', '2002-07-26 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(94053, 3691, 2172, '<td valign="top">Of all of the wood photos this week, this is really great - and on it''s own.  Liking:  Angle, focus, composition, cropping, the sand in the crevices, the water below - everything.  I give it a 10!  Wonderful Work!!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Of all of the wood photos this week, this is really great - and on it''s own.  Liking:  Angle, focus, composition, cropping, the sand in the crevices, the water below - everything.  I give it a 10!  Wonderful Work!!Ruthann', '2002-07-26 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94054, 3691, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how you have framed this shot, and the focus is wonderful.  I now it is outof your control, but if there had been something really interesting through the "aperture" that would have been cool. karmat</td>', 'I like how you have framed this shot, and the focus is wonderful.  I now it is outof your control, but if there had been something really interesting through the "aperture" that would have been cool. karmat', '2002-07-26 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94055, 3691, 472, '<td valign="top">SHARPNESS.  I like it.  Good design. what''s the white thing in the hole though?  I like it but it''s distracting.</td>', 'SHARPNESS.  I like it.  Good design. what''s the white thing in the hole though?  I like it but it''s distracting.', '2002-07-28 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94056, 3691, 2, '<td valign="top">Wow -- really cool effect.  I just love the muted green in the background... it almost seems painted.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow -- really cool effect.  I just love the muted green in the background... it almost seems painted.  Nice job.', '2002-07-28 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94057, 3692, 2200, '<td valign="top">too soft focus. texture suffers</td>', 'too soft focus. texture suffers', '2002-07-22 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94058, 3692, 2638, '<td valign="top">I like the soft look, cool picture!</td>', 'I like the soft look, cool picture!', '2002-07-22 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94059, 3692, 2842, '<td valign="top">Would be nicer with little bit more focus</td>', 'Would be nicer with little bit more focus', '2002-07-22 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94060, 3692, 674, '<td valign="top">Focus not sharp enough! lovely colours!</td>', 'Focus not sharp enough! lovely colours!', '2002-07-22 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94061, 3692, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think the object needs to be more in focus.This is way too much out of focus to be a "soft focus" subject.The upper edge needs cropping,there is something there that distracts.</td>', 'I think the object needs to be more in focus.This is way too much out of focus to be a "soft focus" subject.The upper edge needs cropping,there is something there that distracts.', '2002-07-22 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94062, 3692, 1, '<td valign="top">Blurry or out of focus.  Try more light if blur is the problem.</td>', 'Blurry or out of focus.  Try more light if blur is the problem.', '2002-07-22 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94063, 3692, 573, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a very interesting piece, but the image blur, IMO, dosen''t work for this subject.</td>', 'This looks like it could be a very interesting piece, but the image blur, IMO, dosen''t work for this subject.', '2002-07-22 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94064, 3692, 1005, '<td valign="top">Soft focus?  (On purpose?)  Crop the chairleg, too.  4 Swash</td>', 'Soft focus?  (On purpose?)  Crop the chairleg, too.  4 Swash', '2002-07-22 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94065, 3692, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful piece!  I wish it could have been lit a bit more strongly/ directly to highlight those details.  Cropping out the table leg in the upper left would enhance this, too.</td>', 'What a beautiful piece!  I wish it could have been lit a bit more strongly/ directly to highlight those details.  Cropping out the table leg in the upper left would enhance this, too.', '2002-07-22 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94066, 3692, 2437, '<td valign="top">blurred</td>', 'blurred', '2002-07-23 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94067, 3692, 2858, '<td valign="top">but surely this is a UFO?</td>', 'but surely this is a UFO?', '2002-07-23 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94068, 3692, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but the subject and the background are out of focus.  The subject is also not well-centered in the frame.  It''s difficult to frame a round object in a rectangular format sometimes...  = 5  - jmsetzler</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but the subject and the background are out of focus.  The subject is also not well-centered in the frame.  It''s difficult to frame a round object in a rectangular format sometimes...  = 5  - jmsetzler', '2002-07-23 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94069, 3692, 878, '<td valign="top">I think the framing on this shot could of been more interesting, also the shot is out of focus.  if you could of gotten  1/2 or even a 1/4 of the item filling 80% of the frame it would of been better.  This would of require that you use possibly a macro setting on your camera.</td>', 'I think the framing on this shot could of been more interesting, also the shot is out of focus.  if you could of gotten  1/2 or even a 1/4 of the item filling 80% of the frame it would of been better.  This would of require that you use possibly a macro setting on your camera.', '2002-07-23 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94070, 3692, 2466, '<td valign="top">good texture.  You might want to read the Rule of Thirds tutorial.</td>', 'good texture.  You might want to read the Rule of Thirds tutorial.', '2002-07-23 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94071, 3692, 806, '<td valign="top">out of focus. lacks interest. sorry.</td>', 'out of focus. lacks interest. sorry.', '2002-07-23 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94072, 3692, 2091, '<td valign="top">to blurry</td>', 'to blurry', '2002-07-23 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94073, 3692, 1796, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid your camera wasn''t up to the job. the picture looks like it''s got terribly soft focus, at least. might even be slightly shaken, I don''t know. I see what you try to do texture-wise, but the technical quality of the shot ruins the concept. also, try to make the file as big as possible, i.e. close to 150 KB to lose as little as possible of its definition. 3 beegee</td>', 'I''m afraid your camera wasn''t up to the job. the picture looks like it''s got terribly soft focus, at least. might even be slightly shaken, I don''t know. I see what you try to do texture-wise, but the technical quality of the shot ruins the concept. also, try to make the file as big as possible, i.e. close to 150 KB to lose as little as possible of its definition. 3 beegee', '2002-07-24 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94074, 3692, 1024, '<td valign="top">The subject is interesting enough from a texture standpoint, but there needs to be at least one thing in focus to draw the eye.  What ever is in focus  becomes the subject, and without that, there is no real subject and the eye wanders without a place to stop.</td>', 'The subject is interesting enough from a texture standpoint, but there needs to be at least one thing in focus to draw the eye.  What ever is in focus  becomes the subject, and without that, there is no real subject and the eye wanders without a place to stop.', '2002-07-24 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94075, 3692, 2317, '<td valign="top">Unfocused</td>', 'Unfocused', '2002-07-24 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94076, 3692, 749, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this has already been said, but it needs focus! :o) The lighting is good as far as I can tell, though perhaps a lower angle would have picked up more of the relief across the surface (but its hard to tell without the object in focus).<br/>- Manic -</td>', 'I''m sure this has already been said, but it needs focus! :o) The lighting is good as far as I can tell, though perhaps a lower angle would have picked up more of the relief across the surface (but its hard to tell without the object in focus).- Manic -', '2002-07-24 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94077, 3692, 1041, '<td valign="top">i think this is a beautiful item you bought at the yard sale, but it''s blurry.  i''m wondering whether you tried to go for a soft focus here (the color of the background works well for that), but i would really have preferred the item to be in focus.  sorry.  there''s also something protruding into the picture at the top left, maybe a chair leg? -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'i think this is a beautiful item you bought at the yard sale, but it''s blurry.  i''m wondering whether you tried to go for a soft focus here (the color of the background works well for that), but i would really have preferred the item to be in focus.  sorry.  there''s also something protruding into the picture at the top left, maybe a chair leg? -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-24 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94078, 3692, 2667, '<td valign="top">i have one of these, and know their texture very well. Unfortunately it does not come through in your photo. the focus is too soft, perhaps using a tripod or making sure your cameras macro mode (if it has one) is engaged. also the image itself is a bit plain, getting much closer (just the table or a portion of it) would show off the  texture in the wood better and make for a much stronger image overall, i think.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...3<br/>Meets Challenge...4<br/>Overall...4</td>', 'i have one of these, and know their texture very well. Unfortunately it does not come through in your photo. the focus is too soft, perhaps using a tripod or making sure your cameras macro mode (if it has one) is engaged. also the image itself is a bit plain, getting much closer (just the table or a portion of it) would show off the  texture in the wood better and make for a much stronger image overall, i think.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...3Meets Challenge...4Overall...4', '2002-07-24 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94079, 3692, 2716, '<td valign="top">A little more focus on the centre would have made this shot more interesting.  Nice idea.</td>', 'A little more focus on the centre would have made this shot more interesting.  Nice idea.', '2002-07-24 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94080, 3692, 472, '<td valign="top">neat object. images is overly blurry.  i think that this is caught midair.  i wonder why you went that route?</td>', 'neat object. images is overly blurry.  i think that this is caught midair.  i wonder why you went that route?', '2002-07-24 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94081, 3692, 1202, '<td valign="top"><br/>Composition5<br/>Originality6<br/>Technical  Aspects5<br/>Meets Challenge5<br/>Total Score5<br/><br/>For those that are just learning, like me.<br/><br/>Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.<br/><br/>Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.<br/><br/>Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.<br/><br/>Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.<br/><br/>There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   <br/><br/>Good luck!<br/><br/>Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Originality6Technical  Aspects5Meets Challenge5Total Score5For those that are just learning, like me.Composition:   Scoring in this area is based on basic composition of a picture and includes the rule of thirds, balance, cropping, and curved and diagonal lines.   Subject matter that does not lend itself to the picture or otherwise unwanted is also considered here.Originality:   Scoring in this area is based on pictures or concepts that I have seen, as well as how much effort you have invested in the picture.   Usually a little something that sets it aside from a snapshot.   Does it make me want to come back for another look?  You know things like that.Technical Aspects:   Focus, exposure, lighting, and other special effects (done by the camera), and post processing are all considered in this category.Meets Challenge:   This is based on my interpretation of if you, have/have not, met the challenge.   This is fairly simple but quite important for this site.There are many sites that can give you assistance in achieving better skills in photography, but I think the best way to learn is to take pictures and show them to other people.   Believe me when it is a good one you will know it.   Good luck!Autool', '2002-07-24 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94082, 3692, 1360, '<td valign="top">Picture seems fuzzy</td>', 'Picture seems fuzzy', '2002-07-24 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94083, 3692, 1944, '<td valign="top">You did a good job showing the textures, and your exposure is right on, but I think you tried to hand hold your camera at too low a shutter speed and there''s some blur. Also, you would get more resolution quality if you used the who 150k file size we''re allowed.</td>', 'You did a good job showing the textures, and your exposure is right on, but I think you tried to hand hold your camera at too low a shutter speed and there''s some blur. Also, you would get more resolution quality if you used the who 150k file size we''re allowed.', '2002-07-25 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94084, 3692, 811, '<td valign="top">It comes across being a little flat.  I like the contrast/complimentary colors of the blues and tans.  I think to really make this picture stand out, I would get down more on level with the surface, and let the shadows create depth.  That way the viewer would feel the surface more, instead of just seeing it.  karmat</td>', 'It comes across being a little flat.  I like the contrast/complimentary colors of the blues and tans.  I think to really make this picture stand out, I would get down more on level with the surface, and let the shadows create depth.  That way the viewer would feel the surface more, instead of just seeing it.  karmat', '2002-07-25 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94085, 3692, 2158, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough.</td>', 'Not sharp enough.', '2002-07-25 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94086, 3692, 121, '<td valign="top">I''ll buy it! what is it? I would have prefered not to see all that background at either side. The crop at the base seems about right. This looks more like a deliberate soft focus than just out of focus, if I am right I would have prefered it to be sharp, the relief of the design would have stood out better maybe.</td>', 'I''ll buy it! what is it? I would have prefered not to see all that background at either side. The crop at the base seems about right. This looks more like a deliberate soft focus than just out of focus, if I am right I would have prefered it to be sharp, the relief of the design would have stood out better maybe.', '2002-07-26 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94087, 3692, 2337, '<td valign="top">The focus came out too soft.  I double checked on different monitors to be sure it wasn''t me.  You might have wanted to come in closer on it.  The chair leg in the upper left didn''t help either. On an unrelated note,  If I saw this at a yard sale, I''d snap it up in a minute...</td>', 'The focus came out too soft.  I double checked on different monitors to be sure it wasn''t me.  You might have wanted to come in closer on it.  The chair leg in the upper left didn''t help either. On an unrelated note,  If I saw this at a yard sale, I''d snap it up in a minute...', '2002-07-27 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94088, 3692, 1280, '<td valign="top">not focused well.</td>', 'not focused well.', '2002-07-28 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94089, 3692, 921, '<td valign="top">I think sharper focus would have worked better IMO</td>', 'I think sharper focus would have worked better IMO', '2002-07-28 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94090, 3693, 674, '<td valign="top">overexposure at the top spoils this</td>', 'overexposure at the top spoils this', '2002-07-22 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94091, 3693, 1, '<td valign="top">Great detail and crop.</td>', 'Great detail and crop.', '2002-07-22 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94092, 3693, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, love this kitty''s eyes.Kee</td>', 'Nice work, love this kitty''s eyes.Kee', '2002-07-22 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94093, 3693, 2223, '<td valign="top">how cute...</td>', 'how cute...', '2002-07-22 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94094, 3693, 2256, '<td valign="top">You know, I read a lot of comments from a lot of people and I seem to hear a lot of "no more flowers, children or pets..."  <br/>Personally, they happen to be my three favorite subjects! And this is the reason why! This little guy is a beauty!  GREAT shot! I love it!</td>', 'You know, I read a lot of comments from a lot of people and I seem to hear a lot of "no more flowers, children or pets..."  Personally, they happen to be my three favorite subjects! And this is the reason why! This little guy is a beauty!  GREAT shot! I love it!', '2002-07-22 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94095, 3693, 1993, '<td valign="top">What a sweet face!  It gets a little pixelated...but not where it counts.  I like this shot a lot!</td>', 'What a sweet face!  It gets a little pixelated...but not where it counts.  I like this shot a lot!', '2002-07-22 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94096, 3693, 1796, '<td valign="top">might do even better in a pet challenge but I DO love the cat and the composition and details are really nice. negative: too bright at the top of the frame. 7 beegee</td>', 'might do even better in a pet challenge but I DO love the cat and the composition and details are really nice. negative: too bright at the top of the frame. 7 beegee', '2002-07-22 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94097, 3693, 1644, '<td valign="top">Did you drug this cat? I don''t know how you got it to lay so still! it looks like a greeting card, very nice. I even like the brightness on the side of the face.</td>', 'Did you drug this cat? I don''t know how you got it to lay so still! it looks like a greeting card, very nice. I even like the brightness on the side of the face.', '2002-07-22 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94098, 3693, 352, '<td valign="top">excellent catch light in the eyes.  The shot has them staring right in. Great job</td>', 'excellent catch light in the eyes.  The shot has them staring right in. Great job', '2002-07-23 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94099, 3693, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5,<br/>Technical Aspects5,<br/>Meets Challenge4,<br/>Originality4,<br/>Average Score5,<br/>Autool.<br/></td>', 'Composition5,Technical Aspects5,Meets Challenge4,Originality4,Average Score5,Autool.', '2002-07-23 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94100, 3693, 2350, '<td valign="top">Sweet</td>', 'Sweet', '2002-07-23 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94101, 3693, 2888, '<td valign="top">i think this shot is beautiful! nice focus, close up and excellent texture. the compostion is good and its just wonderful to look at! good job!</td>', 'i think this shot is beautiful! nice focus, close up and excellent texture. the compostion is good and its just wonderful to look at! good job!', '2002-07-23 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94102, 3693, 772, '<td valign="top">this is just simply beautiful... i love every aspect of this image... the composition is right on the money... great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is just simply beautiful... i love every aspect of this image... the composition is right on the money... great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
