(94104, 3693, 2172, '<td valign="top">Yes, hang this up.  I know some are against the pet thing, but when it''s good, it''s good - and this is good.  I really like the composition/cropping.  One small thing is the lighting at the top, but yet I like it.  This is a great photo!  Wonderful work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Yes, hang this up.  I know some are against the pet thing, but when it''s good, it''s good - and this is good.  I really like the composition/cropping.  One small thing is the lighting at the top, but yet I like it.  This is a great photo!  Wonderful work.Ruthann', '2002-07-25 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
