(94211, 3700, 2810, '<td valign="top">Textbook example of texture!  If that was the only criteria, you''d get a 10!  But...this pic seems to have been sharpened a bit too much, and is a bit bright on the lower left corner.  Also, I would like to see a bit more creativity in the shots for a "challenge" vs. wallpaper shots.</td>', 'Textbook example of texture!  If that was the only criteria, you''d get a 10!  But...this pic seems to have been sharpened a bit too much, and is a bit bright on the lower left corner.  Also, I would like to see a bit more creativity in the shots for a "challenge" vs. wallpaper shots.', '2002-07-23 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94212, 3700, 2858, '<td valign="top">nice pic, but surely upside down?</td>', 'nice pic, but surely upside down?', '2002-07-23 05:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
