(94501, 3714, 2703, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of cool elements to this picture: Shadows, angles, repeating patterns. The problem is that there are too many elements and it''s distracting. My eye is wandering all over the picture. Next time you might want to take a few steps forward (if that''s possible) and focus on one element.</td>', 'There are a lot of cool elements to this picture: Shadows, angles, repeating patterns. The problem is that there are too many elements and it''s distracting. My eye is wandering all over the picture. Next time you might want to take a few steps forward (if that''s possible) and focus on one element.', '2002-07-24 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94502, 3714, 1041, '<td valign="top">hm.  i can see why you took this for shadow, and the lines make it a little more abstract.  still, unfortunately, this shot doesn''t look so interesting to me (subject wise) and i''m not sure what i would suggest as a change.  sorry. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'hm.  i can see why you took this for shadow, and the lines make it a little more abstract.  still, unfortunately, this shot doesn''t look so interesting to me (subject wise) and i''m not sure what i would suggest as a change.  sorry. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-24 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
