(94504, 3714, 1005, '<td valign="top">First, is this really the photo for that title?  I really don''t get it, my dumb!  You have plenty of texture in the cement walls, so that''s O.K.  The pole and wires have to go (I hope you are not too attached!)  Finally, estitics, would I hang this photo on my wall?  Would you?  5 Swash</td>', 'First, is this really the photo for that title?  I really don''t get it, my dumb!  You have plenty of texture in the cement walls, so that''s O.K.  The pole and wires have to go (I hope you are not too attached!)  Finally, estitics, would I hang this photo on my wall?  Would you?  5 Swash', '2002-07-25 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94505, 3714, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective, and good focus/lighting.  Instead of having the pole and lines leading out of the picture, I think it would have been better to have it on the right leading into the picture.  Not sure this would have been possible and still get the leaves, etc.  karmat</td>', 'Very interesting perspective, and good focus/lighting.  Instead of having the pole and lines leading out of the picture, I think it would have been better to have it on the right leading into the picture.  Not sure this would have been possible and still get the leaves, etc.  karmat', '2002-07-25 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
