(94593, 3720, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and composition of your photo, but the fact that the right side of the bush is out of focus doesn''t help the quality of it. Also, I notice that the file size of your entry is only 92k. There are significant sharpness problems caused by over compressing. Try to use the whole 150k we are allowed to use and you will see a difference in sharpness, especially in the fine detail like the flowers.</td>', 'I like the texture and composition of your photo, but the fact that the right side of the bush is out of focus doesn''t help the quality of it. Also, I notice that the file size of your entry is only 92k. There are significant sharpness problems caused by over compressing. Try to use the whole 150k we are allowed to use and you will see a difference in sharpness, especially in the fine detail like the flowers.', '2002-07-26 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(94594, 3720, 806, '<td valign="top">Hard to get these fluffy flowers into focus.... but they do need to be sharper. The rock ledge (?) in the top right corner needs to be eliminated or included more to be part of the subject.</td>', 'Hard to get these fluffy flowers into focus.... but they do need to be sharper. The rock ledge (?) in the top right corner needs to be eliminated or included more to be part of the subject.', '2002-07-26 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
