(94648, 3725, 2586, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. Love the subdued colors, the different colors of the rusty screws and the shiny nail. Even though the subject matter is "simple", there is a lot going on to interest the eye. Personally, I like quiet pics such as this. Well done.</td>', 'Just beautiful. Love the subdued colors, the different colors of the rusty screws and the shiny nail. Even though the subject matter is "simple", there is a lot going on to interest the eye. Personally, I like quiet pics such as this. Well done.', '2002-07-24 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
