(94650, 3725, 2596, '<td valign="top">I like this one. I almost can feel the steel. Maby the shadow pull it a little bit down. All the details in the wood are great...but anyway. .nice work</td>', 'I like this one. I almost can feel the steel. Maby the shadow pull it a little bit down. All the details in the wood are great...but anyway. .nice work', '2002-07-24 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
