(94881, 3737, 436, '<td valign="top">The lighting needed to be balanced from the other side to give it more punch. Did you consider carrying a small piece of white foamcore with you. It will reflect the available light and allow you more leeway in your options, especially in the field, than a second, electric, lightsource.</td>', 'The lighting needed to be balanced from the other side to give it more punch. Did you consider carrying a small piece of white foamcore with you. It will reflect the available light and allow you more leeway in your options, especially in the field, than a second, electric, lightsource.', '2002-07-24 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
