(94907, 3738, 308, '<td valign="top">thanks for all of the comments - i really appreciate them.  i was extremely happy with my score and placement in this challenge.<br/><br/>to respond to a few thoughts:<br/><br/>- i did take shots using perspective and trying to capture the painting at different angles, but i didn''t like how it looked.  my camera wasn''t able to capture a good, crisp image at an angle.  i used this shot because i liked the level of detail that was captured from the canvas.<br/><br/>- would have liked to have used two colors, yeah.  but i had to work with what i had.  i took pictures of a lot of my recent paintings and this was the one that i really fell in love with because of the big gloop of paint in the middle.  other shots that i took of the other paintings jusdt didn''t have the same feel or detail.<br/><br/>but thanks again for all of the comments.  i do appreciate them!</td>', 'thanks for all of the comments - i really appreciate them.  i was extremely happy with my score and placement in this challenge.to respond to a few thoughts:- i did take shots using perspective and trying to capture the painting at different angles, but i didn''t like how it looked.  my camera wasn''t able to capture a good, crisp image at an angle.  i used this shot because i liked the level of detail that was captured from the canvas.- would have liked to have used two colors, yeah.  but i had to work with what i had.  i took pictures of a lot of my recent paintings and this was the one that i really fell in love with because of the big gloop of paint in the middle.  other shots that i took of the other paintings jusdt didn''t have the same feel or detail.but thanks again for all of the comments.  i do appreciate them!', '2002-07-29 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
