(95023, 3747, 2661, '<td valign="top">an interesting texture. the two things you might consider improving are the composition and the lighting. try getting closer to the turtle''s eye and filling about a quarter of the frame with it. also, avoid using direct flash, if you can, because it tends to wash out the colors and the detail.</td>', 'an interesting texture. the two things you might consider improving are the composition and the lighting. try getting closer to the turtle''s eye and filling about a quarter of the frame with it. also, avoid using direct flash, if you can, because it tends to wash out the colors and the detail.', '2002-07-23 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
