(95112, 3754, 2661, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice texture, but it could stand to be a little more in focus. also, a little color diversity couldn''t hurt. the image also needs a center of interest. I''m not really bothered by the fact that I can''t tell what it is, though. sometimes that''s nice.</td>', 'It''s a nice texture, but it could stand to be a little more in focus. also, a little color diversity couldn''t hurt. the image also needs a center of interest. I''m not really bothered by the fact that I can''t tell what it is, though. sometimes that''s nice.', '2002-07-23 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
