(95141, 3756, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is growing on me.  I started you out as a five (my I don''t know what to think vote), but pondering this text is giving me time to really view this shot.  The subtle color changes, the lonely stag, the dramatic change of texture from farm land to scrub brush.  You should return to this spot in different seasons, there is a lot of potential in this site.  I really like the stag tree, knarled and windswept.  It could be a subject all by itself.  I think the texture value of this shot is low mostly because of it''s sublty, I am going to grade you up, but not a long way.  7 Swash</td>', 'This is growing on me.  I started you out as a five (my I don''t know what to think vote), but pondering this text is giving me time to really view this shot.  The subtle color changes, the lonely stag, the dramatic change of texture from farm land to scrub brush.  You should return to this spot in different seasons, there is a lot of potential in this site.  I really like the stag tree, knarled and windswept.  It could be a subject all by itself.  I think the texture value of this shot is low mostly because of it''s sublty, I am going to grade you up, but not a long way.  7 Swash', '2002-07-24 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95142, 3756, 573, '<td valign="top">That has got to be a very desolate place.  One of my tens.</td>', 'That has got to be a very desolate place.  One of my tens.', '2002-07-24 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
