(95145, 3756, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photograph, a little on the grainy side but still good.  In terms of texture, its slightly lacking. 6</td>', 'This is a very nice photograph, a little on the grainy side but still good.  In terms of texture, its slightly lacking. 6', '2002-07-27 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95146, 3756, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The composition is excellent, but I wish the color punched a little harer in this one.  I downloaded this photo and played with some hue and saturation adjustments on one, contrast on another, and then finally made a black and white out of it.  Each added some amount of punch to the photo.  What I see that is difficult in this image is some amount of pixellation in the image.  The only thing I can think of that may have caused this is either a digital zoom or this being cropped out of a much larger image possibly... = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The composition is excellent, but I wish the color punched a little harer in this one.  I downloaded this photo and played with some hue and saturation adjustments on one, contrast on another, and then finally made a black and white out of it.  Each added some amount of punch to the photo.  What I see that is difficult in this image is some amount of pixellation in the image.  The only thing I can think of that may have caused this is either a digital zoom or this being cropped out of a much larger image possibly... = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-28 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95147, 3756, 806, '<td valign="top">How in the world did this end up in spot 81? I love this. Good job!</td>', 'How in the world did this end up in spot 81? I love this. Good job!', '2002-07-29 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(95148, 3756, 1360, '<td valign="top">Trying to shoot this shot made me REALLY hate my camera.  I constantly got a whole lot of redchannel noise in the whole picture, no matter what I did.  I really think I got dinged (rightly so) due to the technical aspects of this, yet again.   Trying to bring the color out in photoshop also brought out the redchannel noise, as well.   I either need a camera that doesn''t splatter my images with crap, or a crash course in photoshop.  For jmseltzer''s info, this photo was hardly cropped at all, maybe 5-10% of it was cropped.<br/><br/>Thanks for the comments guys.</td>', 'Trying to shoot this shot made me REALLY hate my camera.  I constantly got a whole lot of redchannel noise in the whole picture, no matter what I did.  I really think I got dinged (rightly so) due to the technical aspects of this, yet again.   Trying to bring the color out in photoshop also brought out the redchannel noise, as well.   I either need a camera that doesn''t splatter my images with crap, or a crash course in photoshop.  For jmseltzer''s info, this photo was hardly cropped at all, maybe 5-10% of it was cropped.Thanks for the comments guys.', '2002-07-29 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
