(95158, 3757, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow - I just commented on about 20 pictures that had too little colour. And now I find this one that has too much. Plenty of texture there but the vibrant, almost blocks of colour distract too much from it.</td>', 'Wow - I just commented on about 20 pictures that had too little colour. And now I find this one that has too much. Plenty of texture there but the vibrant, almost blocks of colour distract too much from it.', '2002-07-23 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
