(95161, 3757, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the clean simple arrangement. Colors are great and there is good sharp focus. Good job!</td>', 'Very nice. I like the clean simple arrangement. Colors are great and there is good sharp focus. Good job!', '2002-07-23 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
