(95163, 3757, 436, '<td valign="top">The photo on my monitor seems overly saturated, especially in the reds. I don''t particularly care for the old, declining peppers...although their texture IS different from the others. The arrangement of the peppers is not random enough to be random (all stems pointed inward) nor static enough to form a pattern.  IMHO</td>', 'The photo on my monitor seems overly saturated, especially in the reds. I don''t particularly care for the old, declining peppers...although their texture IS different from the others. The arrangement of the peppers is not random enough to be random (all stems pointed inward) nor static enough to form a pattern.  IMHO', '2002-07-24 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95164, 3757, 2344, '<td valign="top">What kind of light were you using? it seems to have given a purple cast to the shadows and some of the highlights within the peppers on the right. The textures are well handled even though they are subtle. There are leading lines toward the right red peppers and that works well. 9</td>', 'What kind of light were you using? it seems to have given a purple cast to the shadows and some of the highlights within the peppers on the right. The textures are well handled even though they are subtle. There are leading lines toward the right red peppers and that works well. 9', '2002-07-24 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95165, 3757, 1360, '<td valign="top">Reds seem a bit extreme</td>', 'Reds seem a bit extreme', '2002-07-24 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95166, 3757, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of your photo very much, and it has very dramatic colors. So much so in fact, they appear a bit clipped.</td>', 'I like the composition of your photo very much, and it has very dramatic colors. So much so in fact, they appear a bit clipped.', '2002-07-25 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
