(95193, 3758, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting, just not jumping out at me.  Definately texture and good clarity/focus. 7<br/>ruthann</td>', 'Interesting, just not jumping out at me.  Definately texture and good clarity/focus. 7ruthann', '2002-07-27 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95194, 3758, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this wonderful photograph!  Nicely composed, well exposed, fits the theme of the challenge.The smooth and rough textures are clearly defined. The more I look at it though, I become more critical.   In a good way of course.  The oval center is interesting yet it got cut off.  Perhaps turning the camera to the portrait format rather than landscape would work well to compose it differently.<br/>Very nice photograph anyway!  One of my top 10.</td>', 'I love everything about this wonderful photograph!  Nicely composed, well exposed, fits the theme of the challenge.The smooth and rough textures are clearly defined. The more I look at it though, I become more critical.   In a good way of course.  The oval center is interesting yet it got cut off.  Perhaps turning the camera to the portrait format rather than landscape would work well to compose it differently.Very nice photograph anyway!  One of my top 10.', '2002-07-27 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
