(95220, 3761, 2587, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome! This one better end up in the top three otherwise I will be really disappointed in the voters.  ;-) I''ve rated all images for this challenge and yours is the only perfect 10 I gave. My reasons: great composition, focus, exposure, lighting and, of course, unique subject. Excellent work!</td>', 'Absolutely awesome! This one better end up in the top three otherwise I will be really disappointed in the voters.  ;-) I''ve rated all images for this challenge and yours is the only perfect 10 I gave. My reasons: great composition, focus, exposure, lighting and, of course, unique subject. Excellent work!', '2002-07-22 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
