(95225, 3761, 2586, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this image. Very original. When the image slowly unrolled on my screen (have a slow modem) was wondering what those mountains had to do with the egg. Then I discovered it was the carton! lol Just see a little too much sepia in the carton, not enough contrast and don''t care for the black "shape" above the egg.</td>', 'Oh, I like this image. Very original. When the image slowly unrolled on my screen (have a slow modem) was wondering what those mountains had to do with the egg. Then I discovered it was the carton! lol Just see a little too much sepia in the carton, not enough contrast and don''t care for the black "shape" above the egg.', '2002-07-22 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95226, 3761, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice creative shot, though you''ve lost most of the texture of the egg shell.  Different lighting would probably have messed up the cardboard though.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice creative shot, though you''ve lost most of the texture of the egg shell.  Different lighting would probably have messed up the cardboard though.  I like it.', '2002-07-22 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
