(95238, 3761, 772, '<td valign="top">I like it :)  The texture here creates some nice teasing lines and shadows for sure...  I also like the fact that I can see the surface texture on the top of the egg.  You did a great job on this photo... I would have probably blown the egg surface completely out if I tried this :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like it :)  The texture here creates some nice teasing lines and shadows for sure...  I also like the fact that I can see the surface texture on the top of the egg.  You did a great job on this photo... I would have probably blown the egg surface completely out if I tried this :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-24 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
