(95244, 3761, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea. I love all the textures of the carton and the lighting is great...the shadows really enhance the photo. Even the texture on the egg can be seen. Great job. 8 kdjohnson</td>', 'This is a great idea. I love all the textures of the carton and the lighting is great...the shadows really enhance the photo. Even the texture on the egg can be seen. Great job. 8 kdjohnson', '2002-07-26 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
