(95279, 3763, 1066, '<td valign="top">I am one of the folks here that probably doesn''t go for the wallpaper, full frame photo of texture as much as a having a subject like a ball of yarn filling a portion of the frame with depth of feild providing a background.  I realize this is personal preference.  That being said..I really like the colors here and think there is a tremendous potential in the subject...5..hokie</td>', 'I am one of the folks here that probably doesn''t go for the wallpaper, full frame photo of texture as much as a having a subject like a ball of yarn filling a portion of the frame with depth of feild providing a background.  I realize this is personal preference.  That being said..I really like the colors here and think there is a tremendous potential in the subject...5..hokie', '2002-07-25 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
