(95338, 3766, 1041, '<td valign="top">awesome colors and great catch for this challenge.  the only thing i find slightly distracting is the shadows, was there a way of coming back at a different time to take the shot?  there may not have been.  in any case, i like your entry a lot, you are in my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'awesome colors and great catch for this challenge.  the only thing i find slightly distracting is the shadows, was there a way of coming back at a different time to take the shot?  there may not have been.  in any case, i like your entry a lot, you are in my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-07-25 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95339, 3766, 1005, '<td valign="top">When this is over, check Tom Walthrop''s entry, were you at the same dumpster?<br/>Great color, focus, composition.  I just wish rust were more visually appealing to me.  The best I can go is 8 (for estitics, and Tom got the same score for the same reasons).  Swash</td>', 'When this is over, check Tom Walthrop''s entry, were you at the same dumpster?Great color, focus, composition.  I just wish rust were more visually appealing to me.  The best I can go is 8 (for estitics, and Tom got the same score for the same reasons).  Swash', '2002-07-26 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
