(95396, 3771, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good capture. The only thing I might add is that with the rocks in the foreground so prominent, they should be in focus too.</td>', 'Nice idea and good capture. The only thing I might add is that with the rocks in the foreground so prominent, they should be in focus too.', '2002-07-25 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
