(95440, 3773, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  For me, not very appealing.  That aside, good crop and focus - possibly a little too much contrast and/or light.  I think this is definately different, but maybe the title could be different (sort of get that strange sick feeling in stomach) - I think just "mystery" would''ve been enough.  How did it look in purple?  The color is kinda cool though. - Sort of a ''funky'' abstract photo.  Good job.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Interesting.  For me, not very appealing.  That aside, good crop and focus - possibly a little too much contrast and/or light.  I think this is definately different, but maybe the title could be different (sort of get that strange sick feeling in stomach) - I think just "mystery" would''ve been enough.  How did it look in purple?  The color is kinda cool though. - Sort of a ''funky'' abstract photo.  Good job.Ruthann', '2002-07-25 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95441, 3773, 811, '<td valign="top">hey, I think you know the cafeteria workers from my old middle school.  definitely interesting.</td>', 'hey, I think you know the cafeteria workers from my old middle school.  definitely interesting.', '2002-07-25 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95442, 3773, 2490, '<td valign="top">My biggest complaint in this challenge is about pictures that are filled with only texture.  I would recommend doing something to add shape and depth to your picture here.  The green is a neat idea, but the composition needs a little more :-) 5</td>', 'My biggest complaint in this challenge is about pictures that are filled with only texture.  I would recommend doing something to add shape and depth to your picture here.  The green is a neat idea, but the composition needs a little more :-) 5', '2002-07-26 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
