(95465, 3774, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea and picture.  The slight blur is effective, I think, because it gives the impression of active reading.  There seems to be a slight yellow tint (other than the paper), but I will assume it is on my end.  Great picture.  So far, my favorite.  karmat</td>', 'Great idea and picture.  The slight blur is effective, I think, because it gives the impression of active reading.  There seems to be a slight yellow tint (other than the paper), but I will assume it is on my end.  Great picture.  So far, my favorite.  karmat', '2002-07-23 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
