(95514, 3775, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is such a great idea.  Was the blur in the lower right corner intentional?  I hope not, I don''t like it.  A wider depth of field, or backing away just a little might have helped.  Are the letters colored?  High angle attack shots create nice interest, but also create focal range problems.  I think I would have been happy to see this more straight on.  6 Swash</td>', 'This is such a great idea.  Was the blur in the lower right corner intentional?  I hope not, I don''t like it.  A wider depth of field, or backing away just a little might have helped.  Are the letters colored?  High angle attack shots create nice interest, but also create focal range problems.  I think I would have been happy to see this more straight on.  6 Swash', '2002-07-26 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
